#. /info/title
msgid "CDN Pro API Specification"
msgstr "CDN Pro API 规范"

#. /info/description
msgid ""
"The REST API described in this document can be used to fully automate the "
"CDN Pro service. <p>Along with this document, we also created <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK\">CDNProSDK</a> to help you get "
"started with the API and integrate it. Its <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"mileweb/CDNProSDK/tree/master/cdn/bash\">bash</a> version includes the "
"\"cdnapi.sh\" shell script used in this document's examples.</p>"
msgstr ""
"您可以使用本文档介绍的 REST API 实现 CDN Pro 服务的全面自动化。<p>除本文档"
"外，我们还提供了 <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK\">CDNProSDK</"
"a>，帮助您快速上手并集成 API。其 <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/"
"CDNProSDK/tree/master/cdn/bash\">bash</a> 版本包含本文档示例中使用的 "
"\"cdnapi.sh\" 脚本。</p>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/description
msgid "Get the detailed configuration of a property version."
msgstr "获取加速项目版本的详细配置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains the full details of the property version configuration."
msgstr "响应包含该加速项目版本配置的完整详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/headers/Last-Modified/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}/get/responses/200/headers/Last-Modified/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/headers/Last-Modified/description
#. (+8 more)
msgid ""
"The date and time at which the resource was last modified, in RFC 1123 "
"format."
msgstr "资源最后一次修改的日期和时间，采用 RFC 1123 格式。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "propertyVersion"
msgstr "propertyVersion"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid ""
"This describes a property version. It includes all of the configuration "
"along with information about its deployment status."
msgstr "描述一个加速项目版本，包含全部配置以及该版本的部署状态信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/version/description
msgid "Identifies the property version."
msgstr "标识加速项目版本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. (+1 more)
msgid "propertyConfiguration"
msgstr "propertyConfiguration"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "Describes a property configuration. This contains all the settings."
msgstr "描述一个加速项目配置，包含所有设置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "A description of the version.\n"
msgstr "该版本的描述。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/hostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnames/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"Hostnames associated with the property. A valid value is a fully qualified "
"hostname such as www.domain.com or a wildcard hostname such as *.domain.com. "
"Any given hostname can only be in one deployed property at a particular "
"time. However, a wildcard hostname is permitted to overlap other hostnames "
"you own."
msgstr ""
"与该加速项目关联的加速域名。有效值为完全限定域名(例如 www.domain.com) 或泛域"
"名（例如 *.domain.com）。同一时间内，任一加速域名只能存在于一个已部署的加速项"
"目中。但泛域名可以与您拥有的其他加速域名重叠。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hasBeian/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"The value indicates whether all the hostnames in this property have Beian "
"license on file with the Chinese government. This is required to serve this "
"property from servers in mainland China. A value of <i>false</i> means "
"servers outside of mainland China will be used to distribute content to "
"visitors in China. If set to <i>true</i> you must also specify the content "
"type in the <i>beianContentType</i> field."
msgstr ""
"该值表示此加速项目中的所有加速域名是否都已向中国政府办理 ICP 备案。如需通过中"
"国大陆的服务器为该加速项目提供服务，必须先完成备案。值为 <i>false</i> 时，将"
"使用中国大陆以外的服务器向中国境内的访问者分发内容。如果设置为 <i>true</i>，"
"您还必须在 <i>beianContentType</i> 字段中指定内容类型。"

