#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/description
msgid ""
"This API lets you update a property version. Please note that a property "
"version that has already been deployed to production or staging is 'frozen' "
"and cannot be updated again. The only exception is that the version "
"description can be updated. If a property version is frozen, you should "
"instead <a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/"
"createpropertyversion\">create a new property version</a> with your desired "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过此 API 修改加速项目版本。请注意，已部署到生产环境或演练环境的加速项"
"目版本会被“冻结”，无法再修改，唯一的例外是版本描述仍可修改。如果加速项目版本"
"已被冻结，您应改为<a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/"
"createpropertyversion\">创建一个新的加速项目版本</a>并在其中进行所需的修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid "The body consists of the property configuration you wish to set."
msgstr "请求体包含您要设置的加速项目配置。"

