msgstr "调度域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/hasBeian/description
msgid ""
"Indicates whether you have a Beian license for service in China. If you do, "
"content can be served by servers located within mainland China using the "
"ChinaStandard or ChinaPremium server group.\n"
msgstr ""
"表示您是否拥有在中国提供服务的备案许可。如果有，则可以使用 ChinaStandard 或 "
"ChinaPremium 节点组，由位于中国大陆境内的服务器提供内容。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/title
#. (+2 more)
msgid "Edge Hostname Client Zone Rule"
msgstr "调度域名客户端分区规则"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"This object describes how client requests from a zone are handled. A zone is "
"a combination of a geographic region and an ISP. You can create custom rules "
"to balance performance and cost by selecting the server groups used to "
"deliver content.\n"
"\n"
"An additional server group, \"nearChina\", is available if your domains lack "
"ICP Beian, but you want optimal performance serving Chinese visitors. A "
"client zone rule using nearChina cannot be configured to also deliver to "
"other server groups, though you may create separate client zone rules for "
"those.\n"
"\n"
"If you have an ICP Beian license and want your content to be delivered by "
"servers within China, you can opt to use \"ChinaStandard\" and "
"\"ChinaPremium.\" \n"
"\n"
"Please contact our support team if you require nearChina, ChinaStandard, or "
"ChinaPremium."
msgstr ""
"此对象描述如何处理来自某个分区的客户端请求。分区是地理区域与运营商的组合。您"
"可以通过选择用于分发内容的节点组来创建自定义规则，以平衡性能与成本。\n"
"\n"
"如果您的域名没有 ICP 备案，但又希望为中国访问者提供最佳性能，可以使用额外的服"
"务器组 \"nearChina\"。使用 nearChina 的客户端分区规则不能同时配置为由其他服务"
"器组分发，但您可以为其他节点组另行创建客户端分区规则。\n"
"\n"
"如果您拥有 ICP 备案许可，并希望由中国境内的服务器分发您的内容，可以选择使用 "
"\"ChinaStandard\" 和 \"ChinaPremium.\" \n"
"\n"
"如果您需要 nearChina、ChinaStandard 或 ChinaPremium，请联系我们的技术支持团"
"队。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/region/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/region/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/region/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"This field indicates the region in which the rule applies. Refer to our <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-clientregions\">API to get "
"client regions</a> to get valid region codes. For example, if you wish to "
"create a rule that covers all of Europe, simply specify \"eu\" as the "
"region. You can indicate specific countries. For example, \"na.us\" "
"represents the \"United States of America\", and \"eu.fr\" represents "
"\"France\".\n"
"\n"
"A special client region “all” can be used to specify that the rule applies "
"to the entire world. If overlapping regions are specified, the more specific "
"one takes precedence. For example, if you specify \"as\" in one rule and "
"\"as.cn\" in another, a request from China will follow the rule for "
"\"as.cn\"."
msgstr ""
"此字段表示规则适用的区域。请参阅我们的<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-"
"management/get-cdn-clientregions\">获取客户端区域 API</a> 以获取有效的区域代"
"码。例如，如果您希望创建覆盖整个欧洲的规则，只需将区域指定为 \"eu\"。您也可以"
"指定具体国家。例如，\"na.us\" 表示 \"United States of America\"（美国），"
"\"eu.fr\" 表示 \"France\"（法国）。\n"
"\n"
"可以使用特殊的客户端区域 “all” 来指定规则适用于全球。如果指定的区域存在重叠，"
"则以更具体的区域为准。例如，如果您在一条规则中指定 \"as\"，在另一条规则中指"
"定 \"as.cn\"，则来自中国的请求将遵循 \"as.cn\" 的规则。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/weight/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/weight/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/weight/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"When multiple actions are specified for a client zone, the weight is used to "
"adjust the probability of a client zone rule applying to a client request.\n"
"Consider two rules that apply to \"as.cn\": <code>{\"region\":\"as.cn\", "
"\"isp\":\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":\"deliver\", \"by\":[\"standard\", "
"\"premium\", \"deluxe\"]}},\n"
"    {\"region\":\"as.cn\", \"isp\":\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":"
"\"redirect\", \"to\":[\"alternate.cname.com\"]}, \"weight\":10}</code>\n"
"\n"
" The probability of \"deliver\" will be 100/(100+10) or 0.909 while the "
"probability of \"redirect\" will be 10/(100+10) or 0.091.\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""
"当为一个客户端分区指定了多个操作时，权重用于调整某条客户端分区规则应用于客户"
"端请求的概率。\n"
"假设有两条适用于 \"as.cn\" 的规则：<code>{\"region\":\"as.cn\", \"isp\":"
"\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":\"deliver\", \"by\":[\"standard\", "
"\"premium\", \"deluxe\"]}},\n"
"    {\"region\":\"as.cn\", \"isp\":\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":"
"\"redirect\", \"to\":[\"alternate.cname.com\"]}, \"weight\":10}</code>\n"
"\n"
" \"deliver\" 的概率为 100/(100+10)，即 0.909；\"redirect\" 的概率为 10/"
"(100+10)，即 0.091。\n"
" \n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"This object describes the action to take for requests matching the rule."
msgstr "此对象描述对匹配该规则的请求所执行的操作。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/type/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/type/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/type/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Defines the action to take for requests to the zone. Options are to "
"<i>deliver</i> using one or more server groups, to <i>reject</i> the request "
"altogether, or to <i>redirect</i> to another domain. If \"reject\" is "
"specified, the client request will be redirected to a server that always "
"responds with HTTP response code 403 representing \"Forbidden\". Up to one "
"\"reject\" action is allowed for each client zone.\n"
msgstr ""
"定义对该分区请求所执行的操作。可选项包括：使用一个或多个节点组进行分发"
"（<i>deliver</i>）、直接拒绝请求（<i>reject</i>），或重定向到其他域名"
"（<i>redirect</i>）。如果指定 \"reject\"，客户端请求将被重定向到一台始终返回 "
"HTTP 响应码 403（表示 \"Forbidden\"）的服务器。每个客户端分区最多允许一个 "
"\"reject\" 操作。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/by/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/by/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/by/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"This field is used if the action is of type \"deliver\". Specify one or more "
"of the server groups (<i>standard</i>, <i>premium</i>, <i>deluxe</i>,  "
"<i>ultra</i>, <i>nearChina</i>, <i>ChinaStandard</i>, <i>ChinaPremium</i>) "
"to control the servers used to deliver content. <br/><br/>\"nearChina\" is a "
"special server group that can be enabled for you if your domains lack ICP "
"Beian, but you want optimal performance serving Chinese visitors. A client "
"zone rule using nearChina cannot be configured to simultaneously deliver to "
"other server groups, though you may create separate client zone rules to use "
"other server groups.<br/><br/>If you have an ICP Beian license and want your "
"content to be delivered by servers within China, you can opt to use "
"\"ChinaStandard\" and \"ChinaPremium.\" Please contact our support team if "
"you require nearChina, ChinaStandard, or ChinaPremium.<br/><br/>If an edge "
"hostname is not initially configured to use ChinaStandard or ChinaPremium, "
"you will not be able to modify it later to use these two server groups. "
"Instead, you will need to create a new edge hostname with client zone rules "
"delivering to those server groups."
msgstr ""
"当操作类型为 \"deliver\" 时使用此字段。指定一个或多个节点组（<i>standard</"
"i>、<i>premium</i>、<i>deluxe</i>、<i>ultra</i>、<i>nearChina</i>、"
"<i>ChinaStandard</i>、<i>ChinaPremium</i>）以控制用于分发内容的服务器。<br/"
"><br/>\"nearChina\" 是一个特殊的节点组，如果您的域名没有 ICP 备案，但又希望为"
"中国访问者提供最佳性能，可以为您启用该节点组。使用 nearChina 的客户端分区规则"
"不能同时配置为由其他节点组分发，但您可以另行创建客户端分区规则来使用其他节点"
"组。<br/><br/>如果您拥有 ICP 备案许可，并希望由中国境内的服务器分发您的内容，"
"可以选择使用 \"ChinaStandard\" 和 \"ChinaPremium.\" 如果您需要 nearChina、"
"ChinaStandard 或 ChinaPremium，请联系我们的技术支持团队。<br/><br/>如果调度域"
"名最初未配置为使用 ChinaStandard 或 ChinaPremium，则之后无法将其修改为使用这"
"两个节点组。您需要创建一个新的调度域名，并配置由这些节点组分发的客户端分区规"
"则。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/to/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/to/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/to/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"This field is used if the action is of type \"redirect\". It indicates "
"either a single hostname OR one or more IP addresses to redirect to. This is "
"typically an origin server or another CDN provider."
msgstr ""
"当操作类型为 \"redirect\" 时使用此字段。它表示要重定向到的单个域名，或者一个"
"或多个 IP 地址。通常是源站服务器或其他 CDN 服务商。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/enableIPv6/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/enableIPv6/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/action/properties/enableIPv6/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Indicates whether an IPv6 address can be used. This value is used only if "
"the client zone rule's action type is \"deliver\"."
msgstr ""
"表示是否可以使用 IPv6 地址。仅当客户端分区规则的操作类型为 \"deliver\" 时才使"
"用此值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/clientZones/items/properties/isp/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/items/properties/isp/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/items/properties/isp/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Specify the code representing an ISP (Internet Service Provider) if the rule "
"only applies to requests from a particular ISP. Call our <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"cdn-product-management/get-cdn-isps\">API to get a list of supported ISPs</"
"a>. Specify 'all' to indicate all ISPs rather than a particular one. Specify "
"a comma-separated list of up to 10 ISP codes if you want your rule to apply "
"to more than one ISP."
msgstr ""
"如果规则仅适用于来自特定运营商（ISP，Internet Service Provider）的请求，请指"
"定代表该运营商的代码。请调用我们的<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/"
"get-cdn-isps\">获取支持的运营商列表 API</a>。指定 'all' 表示所有运营商，而不"
"是某个特定运营商。如果希望规则适用于多个运营商，请指定以逗号分隔的列表，最多"
"包含 10 个运营商代码。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/title
#. (+2 more)
msgid "deliverByHttps"
msgstr "deliverByHttps"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Support a DNS resource record that advertises HTTPS support (HTTP/2 and HTTP/"
"3). Clients can potentially improve performance and privacy by making use of "
"the information.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"<code>\n"
"yourEdgehostname.qtlcdn.com 1800 IN HTTPS 1 . alpn=\"h2,h3\" port=443 \n"
"</code>\n"
"\n"
"The returned DNS record does not reflect the destination a request is "
"redirected to if a client zone rule's action is to redirect."
msgstr ""
"支持通过 DNS 资源记录声明对 HTTPS 的支持（HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3）。客户端可以利用"
"这些信息来提升性能和隐私性。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"<code>\n"
"yourEdgehostname.qtlcdn.com 1800 IN HTTPS 1 . alpn=\"h2,h3\" port=443 \n"
"</code>\n"
"\n"
"如果客户端分区规则的操作为重定向，返回的 DNS 记录不会反映请求被重定向到的目"
"标。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/state/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/state/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/state/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "Whether to advertise the HTTPS support through a DNS record."
msgstr "是否通过 DNS 记录声明对 HTTPS 的支持。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/alpn/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/alpn/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/alpn/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Indicates the supported protocols. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Description</"
"td></tr><tr><td>h2</td><td>Supports HTTP/2 </td></tr><tr><td>h3</"
"td><td>Supports HTTP/3</td></tr><tr><td>h2,h3</td><td>Supports both HTTP/2 "
"and HTTP3</td></tr></table>This field is required if <i>state</i> is set to "
"'on' and ignored if it is set to 'off'."
msgstr ""
"表示支持的协议。<table><tr><th>值</th><th>描述</td></tr><tr><td>h2</td><td>支"
"持 HTTP/2 </td></tr><tr><td>h3</td><td>支持 HTTP/3</td></tr><tr><td>h2,h3</"
"td><td>同时支持 HTTP/2 和 HTTP3</td></tr></table>如果 <i>state</i> 设置为 "
"'on'，则此字段为必填；如果设置为 'off'，则忽略此字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/port/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/port/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/port/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"The port supporting HTTPS. This field is ignored if <i>state</i> is set to "
"'off'."
msgstr "支持 HTTPS 的端口。如果 <i>state</i> 设置为 'off'，则忽略此字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/configuration/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/ttl/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/ttl/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/deliverByHttps/properties/ttl/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"Number of seconds the DNS record is valid.  This field is ignored if "
"<i>state</i> is set to 'off'."
msgstr "DNS 记录的有效秒数。如果 <i>state</i> 设置为 'off'，则忽略此字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/finishTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 format date indicating when the operation completed."
msgstr "表示操作完成时间的 RFC 3339 格式日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/status/description
msgid "Status of the operation."
msgstr "操作的状态。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/statusDetails/description
msgid "Additional information about the operation."
msgstr "有关该操作的附加信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/submissionTime/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 format date indicating when the operation was submitted for "
"processing."
msgstr "表示操作提交处理时间的 RFC 3339 格式日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 format date indicating when the edge hostname was last updated."
msgstr "表示调度域名最后修改时间的 RFC 3339 格式日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 format date indicating when the edge hostname was created."
msgstr "表示调度域名创建时间的 RFC 3339 格式日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ownerCustomerId/description
msgid "Indicates the customer account that owns the edge hostname."
msgstr "表示拥有该调度域名的客户账号。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/description
msgid "Contains settings that can be modified."
msgstr "包含可修改的设置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "A description of the edge hostname."
msgstr "调度域名的描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/clientZones/description
msgid ""
"Rules control how requests from client zones are handled. You can create "
"custom rules to balance performance and cost by selecting the server groups "
"used to deliver content."
msgstr ""
"规则用于控制如何处理来自各客户端分区的请求。您可以通过选择用于分发内容的服务"
"器组来创建自定义规则，以平衡性能与成本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/estimatedBandwidth/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/estimatedBandwidth/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/estimatedBandwidth/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"An estimate of the bandwidth required to serve content using this edge "
"hostname. Units of measurement should be in Tbps, Gbps, Mbps, or kbps. "
"Example: 100Gbps"
msgstr ""
"使用此调度域名提供内容所需带宽的估算值。计量单位应为 Tbps、Gbps、Mbps 或 "
"kbps。示例：100Gbps"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/responses/404/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/responses/404/description
msgid "The edge hostname was not found."
msgstr "未找到该调度域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/get/description
msgid ""
"This API returns information about an edge hostname including the associated "
"client zone rules and operation history."
msgstr "此 API 返回调度域名的信息，包括关联的客户端分区规则和操作历史。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete an edge hostname"
msgstr "删除调度域名"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid "The edge hostname was successfully deleted."
msgstr "调度域名已成功删除。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/delete/responses/404/description
msgid "The edge hostname could not be found."
msgstr "找不到该调度域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/delete/description
msgid ""
"Use this API to delete an edge hostname. If you have configured your DNS "
"server with this edge hostname, you should update your DNS records before "
"deleting it. Otherwise, visitors to the associated hostnames will see an "
"error."
msgstr ""
"使用此 API 删除调度域名。如果您已在 DNS 服务器中配置了此调度域名，应在删除前"
"先更新 DNS 记录，否则访问相关加速域名的用户将会看到错误。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/delete/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"By default, we check if the edge hostname has been recently used as "
"determined by the number of requests to it in the past 24 hours. This safety "
"check is intended to protect against accidentally impacting visitors to your "
"content.  You can pass the <i>Check-Usage: no</i> header to bypass this "
"check."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，我们会根据过去 24 小时内的请求数检查该调度域名最近是否被使用。此"
"安全检查旨在防止意外影响您内容的访问者。您可以传入 <i>Check-Usage: no</i> 请"
"求头来跳过此检查。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/parameters/0/description
msgid "an edge hostname"
msgstr "调度域名"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/summary
msgid "Update an edge hostname"
msgstr "修改调度域名"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/responses/204/description
msgid "The edge hostname was updated."
msgstr "调度域名已修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/responses/409/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/responses/409/description
msgid ""
"The edgeHostname field cannot be changed because it may cause a service "
"interruption."
msgstr "无法更改 edgeHostname 字段，因为这可能导致服务中断。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/description
msgid ""
"Use this API to update an edge hostname. Be sure to enter all fields "
"describing your edge hostname including ones that are not changing."
msgstr ""
"使用此 API 修改调度域名。请务必填写描述该调度域名的所有字段，包括未发生变化的"
"字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostname/description
msgid "The edge hostname. It cannot be modified."
msgstr "调度域名。不可修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/clientZones/description
msgid ""
"Specify rules to control how requests from client zones are handled. You "
"must create at least one rule covering all regions and all ISPs. For "
"example, if you have access to the standard, premium, deluxe, and ultra "
"server groups, you could create this rule allowing several of our server "
"groups to handle requests and achieve the best possible performance:\n"
"<code>{\"region\":\"all\", \"isp\":\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":\"deliver\","
"\"by\":[\"standard\",\"premium\",\"deluxe\",\"ultra\"]}}</code>.<br/>If "
"potential cost is a greater concern, you can choose different server groups "
"to balance your cost and performance requirements."
msgstr ""
"指定规则以控制如何处理来自各客户端分区的请求。您必须至少创建一条覆盖所有区域"
"和所有运营商的规则。例如，如果您可以使用 standard、premium、deluxe 和 ultra "
"节点组，可以创建以下规则，允许由多个节点组处理请求，以获得尽可能好的性能：\n"
"<code>{\"region\":\"all\", \"isp\":\"all\", \"action\":{\"type\":\"deliver\","
"\"by\":[\"standard\",\"premium\",\"deluxe\",\"ultra\"]}}</code>。<br/>如果您"
"更关注潜在成本，可以选择不同的节点组来平衡成本和性能需求。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/put/requestBody/description
msgid ""
"The request body fully describes the edge hostname. Please include all "
"fields even if you are not changing their values."
msgstr "请求体完整描述该调度域名。即使您不更改某些字段的值，也请包含所有字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/responses/204/description
msgid "The edge hostname was successfully updated."
msgstr "调度域名已成功修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/responses/404/description
msgid ""
"The edge hostname could not be found. Refer to the response body for details."
msgstr "找不到该调度域名。详情请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/description
msgid ""
"This API allows you to update an edge hostname by sending only the fields "
"that are changing."
msgstr "您可以通过此 API 修改调度域名，只需发送发生变化的字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1edgeHostnames~1{edgeHostname}/patch/requestBody/description
