#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"A new property version was successfully created. A Location header "
"containing the URL of the new property version is returned. Example:  "
"<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/properties/"
"e0d1819863b856c42635ae17/versions/8</code>"
msgstr ""
