"头。示例：<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/properties/"
"e0d1819863b856c42635ae17/versions/8</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL referring to the new property version. The URL follows this format: "
"https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/properties/{propertyId}/versions/{version} "
"where {propertyId} represents the ID of the property and {version} "
"represents the newly created version. If you would like to get the version, "
"simply extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest. "
msgstr ""
"指向新加速项目版本的 URL。URL 格式如下：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/"
"properties/{propertyId}/versions/{version}，其中 {propertyId} 表示加速项目的 "
"ID，{version} 表示新创建的版本。如果您想获取版本号，只需提取路径的最后一部"
"分，忽略其余部分即可。"

