"docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#limit_rate>) directive."
msgstr ""
"[limit_rate](</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#limit_rate>) 指令中允许设"
"置的每秒最大字节数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxUpstreamKeepaliveTimeOut/description
