msgstr "加速项目源站配置的 <i>keepAliveTimeout</i> 字段中允许设置的最大秒数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxOriginConnectTimeOut/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxOriginConnectTimeOut/description
