msgstr ""
"[origin_read_timeout](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#origin_read_timeout>) 指令中允许设置的最大秒数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxOriginSendTimeOut/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxOriginSendTimeOut/description
