#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"Maximum number of seconds permitted in the [origin_send_timeout](</docs/edge-"
"logic/supported-directives#origin_send_timeout>) directive."
msgstr ""
"[origin_send_timeout](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#origin_send_timeout>) 指令中允许设置的最大秒数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxClientHeaderTimeOut/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxClientHeaderTimeOut/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxClientHeaderTimeOut/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"Maximum number of seconds permitted in the [client_header_timeout](</docs/"
"edge-logic/supported-directives#client_header_timeout>) directive."
msgstr ""
"[client_header_timeout](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#client_header_timeout>) 指令中允许设置的最大秒数。"

