#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxClientSendTimeOut/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/directiveParameterLimits/properties/maxClientSendTimeOut/description
