"Maximum number of seconds permitted in the [client_body_timeout](</docs/edge-"
"logic/supported-directives#client_body_timeout>) directive."
msgstr ""
"[client_body_timeout](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#client_body_timeout>) 指令中允许设置的最大秒数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webhookLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webhookLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webhookLimit/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid "Total number of webhooks that can be created."
msgstr "可以创建的 Webhook 的总数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
msgid ""
"Whether the customer will be invoiced using Stripe payment processing. If "
"you are a reseller who plans to use Stripe to bill your child customers, you "
"can specify <i>true</i>. Otherwise, <i>false</i> is more appropriate. "
"{{title}} will not bill your customers for you."
msgstr ""
"是否使用 Stripe 支付处理为该客户开具账单。如果您是代理商，并计划使用 Stripe "
"向子客户收费，可以指定 <i>true</i>；否则，<i>false</i> 更为合适。{{title}} 不"
"会代您向您的客户收费。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secretLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secretLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secretLimit/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid "Total number of secrets that can be created."
msgstr "可以创建的保密信息的总数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"List of zones specifying the domains that can be used for <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"edge-hostname-management\">edge hostnames</a>. Our default is <i>qtlcdn.com</"
"i>. Each new edge hostname you create is a subdomain of .qtlcdn.com (for "
"example, abcdefghi123.qtlcdn.com). If you are a reseller and want to use "
"your own domain as the suffix instead, please contact us about adding this "
"feature to your contract. You will need to delegate the domain's "
"authoritative DNS to us."
msgstr ""
"区域列表，指定可用于<a href=\"/apidocs/edge-hostname-management\">调度域名</"
"a>的域名。默认值为 <i>qtlcdn.com</i>。您创建的每个新调度域名都是 .qtlcdn.com "
"的子域名（例如 abcdefghi123.qtlcdn.com）。如果您是代理商，并希望改用自己的域"
"名作为后缀，请联系我们将此功能加入您的合同。您需要将该域名的权威 DNS 委派给我"
"们。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/name/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid "A domain to use for edge hostnames."
msgstr "用于调度域名的域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"Whether the domain has ICP Beian, which is required for content to be hosted "
"on servers in China. If set to true, every property's hostname that points "
"to an edge hostname using this domain must have ICP Beian."
msgstr ""
"该域名是否已有 ICP 备案（在中国境内的服务器上托管内容需要 ICP 备案）。如果设"
"置为 true，则加速项目中每个指向使用此域名的调度域名的加速域名都必须有 ICP 备"
"案。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxFilePurgeEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxFilePurgeEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxFilePurgeEntries/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"Maximum number of file URLs that can be included in the fileUrls field of a "
"<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">purge request</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">刷新请求</a>的 fileUrls "
"字段中可包含的文件 URL 的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxDirPurgeEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxDirPurgeEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxDirPurgeEntries/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"Maximum number of directory URLs that can be included in the dirUrls field "
"of a <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">purge request</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">刷新请求</a>的 dirUrls 字"
"段中可包含的目录 URL 的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedLbDirectives/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedLbDirectives/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedLbDirectives/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"A list of advanced Edge Logic directives that can be used in the "
"loadBalancerLogic field of a property in addition to the set of basic load "
"balancer directives listed in the  <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/"
"get-cdn-systemconfigs\">system configuration API</a>. If you require an "
"advanced load balancer directive, please contact our support team."
msgstr ""
"除<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-systemconfigs\">系统配置 "
"API</a> 中列出的基本负载均衡指令外，可在加速项目的 loadBalancerLogic 字段中使"
"用的高级 Edge Logic 指令列表。如果您需要高级负载均衡指令，请联系我们的技术支"
"持团队。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
msgid ""
"List of server groups the customer is permitted to use. This can be used to "
"balance performance and cost. Access to a higher level server group includes "
"access to lower level groups. In particular, <i>ultra</i> includes "
"<i>standard</i>, <i>premium</i>, and <i>deluxe</i>; <i>deluxe</i> includes "
"<i>premium</i> and <i>standard</i>; <i>premium</i> includes <i>standard</i>; "
"and <i>ChinaPremium</i> includes <i>ChinaStandard</i>."
msgstr ""
"允许客户使用的节点组列表，可用于平衡性能与成本。拥有较高级别节点组的使用权限"
"即包含较低级别节点组的使用权限。具体而言，<i>ultra</i> 包含 <i>standard</i>、"
"<i>premium</i> 和 <i>deluxe</i>；<i>deluxe</i> 包含 <i>premium</i> 和 "
"<i>standard</i>；<i>premium</i> 包含 <i>standard</i>；<i>ChinaPremium</i> 包"
"含 <i>ChinaStandard</i>。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/privateDomains/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/privateDomains/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/privateDomains/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"List of domains that the customer owns. Only this customer can create "
"properties specifying these domains in the hostnames field. "
msgstr ""
"客户拥有的域名列表。只有该客户可以创建在 hostnames 字段中指定这些域名的加速项"
"目。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/post/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body contains the service quota settings for the customer."
msgstr "请求体包含该客户的服务配额设置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of service quotas"
msgstr "获取服务配额列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response contains a list of service quotas."
msgstr "响应包含服务配额列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid ""
"Total number of service quota entries available. The number returned in "
"serviceQuotaList may be fewer as it is limited to 200 entries."
msgstr ""
"可用的服务配额条目总数。serviceQuotaList 中返回的数量可能更少，因为其上限为 "
"200 条。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/description
msgid "A list of up to 200 service quota summaries."
msgstr "最多包含 200 条服务配额摘要的列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/description
msgid "Summarizes service quotas for a customer."
msgstr "汇总某个客户的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/id/description
msgid ""
"A service quota ID. You can use this to <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-"
"management/get-cdn-servicequotas-servicequotaid\">get more details about the "
"service quota</a>."
msgstr ""
"服务配额 ID。您可以使用它<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-"
"servicequotas-servicequotaid\">获取该服务配额的更多详情</a>。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/status/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the status of access to the CDN Pro product.  An <i>active</i> "
"customer has full access. A <i>suspended</i> customer no longer has access. "
"A <i>trial</i> customer is one with trial settings which may be more limited "
"than those of a customer with the <i>active</i> status."
msgstr ""
"表示使用 CDN Pro 产品的权限状态。<i>active</i> 客户拥有完整的使用权限。"
"<i>suspended</i> 客户不再拥有使用权限。<i>trial</i> 客户采用试用设置，其限制"
"可能比 <i>active</i> 状态的客户更多。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/trialDeadline/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/trialDeadline/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/trialDeadline/description
msgid ""
"A date in RFC 3339 format indicating when the trial expires. This field is "
"required if the <i>status</i> field's value is <i>trial</i>."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示试用到期的时间。如果 <i>status</i> 字段的值为 "
"<i>trial</i>，则此字段为必填项。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/usageLimitDays/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It is used to limit traffic use. It "
"represents the number of days over which the traffic amount designated by "
"the <i>usageLimitDollar</i> field can be used. For example, a value of 90 "
"for <i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the "
"customer can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over 90 day period.\n"
msgstr ""
"此设置适用于试用客户，用于限制流量使用。它表示可以使用 <i>usageLimitDollar</"
"i> 字段所指定流量额度的天数。例如，<i>usageLimitDays</i> 的值为 90、"
"<i>usageLimitDollar</i> 的值为 50，表示客户在 90 天内最多可以使用价值 50 美元"
"的总流量。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It represents the amount of traffic "
"valued in US dollars that is permitted to be used over a period of time  set "
"by the <i>usageLimitDays</i> field. For example, a value of 90 for "
"<i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the customer "
"can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over 90 day period. The dollar "
"value is based on CDN Pro's default pricing.\n"
msgstr ""
"此设置适用于试用客户。它表示在 <i>usageLimitDays</i> 字段设定的时间段内允许使"
"用的流量额度（以美元计价）。例如，<i>usageLimitDays</i> 的值为 90、"
"<i>usageLimitDollar</i> 的值为 50，表示客户在 90 天内最多可以使用价值 50 美元"
"的总流量。美元金额基于 CDN Pro 的默认定价。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicate when the service quota was created."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示服务配额的创建时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaList/items/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the service quota was last updated."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示服务配额的最后修改时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/description
msgid ""
"<b>Resellers</b> can use this API to obtain a list of service quotas of "
"their child customers. Optional query parameters let you filter the results."
msgstr ""
"<b>代理商</b>可以使用此 API 获取其子客户的服务配额列表。您可以使用可选的查询"
"参数筛选结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Return service quota of the caller only.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Include service quotas of children "
"customers only.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include service "
"quotas of both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选的请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</"
"th><th>行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>仅返回调用者的服务配额。</"
"td></tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户的服务配额。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的服务配额。</td></"
"tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/2/description
msgid ""
"Return service quotas with a particular status. By default, all service "
"quotas are returned."
msgstr "返回具有特定状态的服务配额。默认返回所有服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"Return service quotas depending on whether the customer is permitted to "
"deploy to production or not. By default, all are returned regardless."
msgstr ""
"根据客户是否被允许部署到生产环境来返回服务配额。默认情况下不作区分，全部返"
"回。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"If the parameter is specified, return service quotas where both "
"usageLimitDays and usageLimitDollar have non-zero values. The actual "
"parameter value is ignored."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了此参数，则返回 usageLimitDays 和 usageLimitDollar 均为非零值的服务"
"配额。参数的实际取值将被忽略。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/5/description
msgid ""
"Return service quotas of customers permitted to use an advanced [Edge Logic "
"directive](</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#expires>) specified by "
"this parameter."
msgstr ""
"返回被允许使用此参数所指定的高级 [Edge Logic 指令](</docs/edge-logic/"
"supported-directives#expires>)的客户的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/6/description
msgid "Return service quotas whose accountManagerEmail matches this value."
msgstr "返回 accountManagerEmail 与此值匹配的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/7/description
msgid "Index of the first service quota to return."
msgstr "要返回的第一个服务配额的索引。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/8/description
msgid "Maximum number of service quotas to return. "
msgstr "要返回的服务配额的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/9/description
msgid ""
"Specify an advanced feature to search for. Only service quotas with the "
"feature enabled will be returned."
msgstr "指定要搜索的高级功能。仅返回启用了该功能的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas/get/parameters/10/description
msgid ""
"Specify a value to search for among the values of the "
"allowedCacheDirectives, allowedLbDirectives, allowedServerGroups, and "
"advancedFeatures fields. Only service quotas which include the value will be "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"指定要在 allowedCacheDirectives、allowedLbDirectives、allowedServerGroups 和 "
"advancedFeatures 字段的值中搜索的值。仅返回包含该值的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"Specify the service quota ID. It is returned when <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-"
"product-management/post-cdn-servicequotas\">creating a service quota</a>."
msgstr ""
"指定服务配额 ID。该 ID 在<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/post-cdn-"
"servicequotas\">创建服务配额</a>时返回。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/summary
msgid "Get a service quota by service quota ID"
msgstr "按服务配额 ID 获取服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response contains the service quotas for a CDN Pro customer."
msgstr "响应包含某个 CDN Pro 客户的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "serviceQuotaResponse"
msgstr "serviceQuotaResponse"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid "Describes the service quotas for a customer"
msgstr "描述某个客户的服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/serviceQuotaId/description
msgid ""
"An ID for the service quota settings. This is omitted when returning results "
"for a customer who does not have an explicitly defined service quota."
msgstr ""
"服务配额设置的 ID。如果返回的是未明确定义服务配额的客户的结果，则省略此字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/contractId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/contractId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/contractId/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "ID representing the contract used for billing for use of the service."
msgstr "表示合同的 ID，该合同用于对服务的使用进行计费。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnameLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnameLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnameLimit/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "Maximum number of hostnames allowed in production.\n"
msgstr "生产环境中允许的加速域名的最大数量。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/propertyLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/propertyLimit/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/propertyLimit/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "Maximum number of properties that can be created.\n"
msgstr "可以创建的加速项目的最大数量。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedCacheDirectives/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedCacheDirectives/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedCacheDirectives/description
msgid "A list of advanced Edge Logic directives that are permitted to be used."
msgstr "允许使用的高级 Edge Logic 指令列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowDeploymentInChina/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowDeploymentInChina/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowDeploymentInChina/description
msgid ""
"Indicates whether deployment to PoPs in mainland China is permitted. An ICP "
"Beian license is required for web content to be hosted on servers within "
"China."
msgstr ""
"表示是否允许部署到中国大陆的 PoP。在中国境内的服务器上托管网页内容需要 ICP 备"
"案。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/trialDeadline/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/trialDeadline/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/trialDeadline/description
msgid ""
"A date in RFC 3339 format indicating when the trial expires. This field is "
"required if the <i>status</i> field's value  is <i>trial</i>."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示试用到期的时间。如果 <i>status</i> 字段的值为 "
"<i>trial</i>，则此字段为必填项。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/upgradeDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/upgradeDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/upgradeDate/description
msgid ""
"A date in RFC 3339 format indicating when a customer's status changed from "
"<i>trial</i> to <i>active</i>."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示客户状态从 <i>trial</i> 变为 <i>active</i> 的时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/suspensionDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/suspensionDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/suspensionDate/description
msgid ""
"A date in RFC 3339 format indicating when the customer's CDN Pro service was "
"suspended."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示客户的 CDN Pro 服务被暂停的时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/advancedFeatures/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/advancedFeatures/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/advancedFeatures/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"List of advanced features that are available to the customer. Currently "
"supported features include: \"realTimeLog\", which allows a customer to "
"monitor requests from their client as they are received; \"nearChina\" "
"allowing a customer without ICP Beian to use a server group consisting of "
"nodes close to mainland China; and \"originShield\", which provides an extra "
"layer of servers between the CDN Pro edge servers and origin servers. Please "
"contact our support team if you require an advanced feature."
msgstr ""
"客户可使用的高级功能列表。目前支持的功能包括：\"realTimeLog\"，允许客户在收到"
"请求时实时监控来自其客户端的请求；\"nearChina\"，允许没有 ICP 备案的客户使用"
"由靠近中国大陆的节点组成的节点组；以及 \"originShield\"，在 CDN Pro 边缘服务"
"器与源站服务器之间增加一层额外的服务器。如果您需要某项高级功能，请联系我们的"
"技术支持团队。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/billUsingStripe/description
msgid "Whether the customer will be invoiced using Stripe payment processing."
msgstr "是否使用 Stripe 支付处理为该客户开具账单。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/terminationDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/terminationDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/terminationDate/description
msgid ""
"A date in RFC 3339 format indicating when the customer's CDN Pro service was "
"terminated."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示客户的 CDN Pro 服务被终止的时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
msgid "List of server groups that the customer is permitted to use."
msgstr "允许客户使用的节点组列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the service quota was created."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示服务配额的创建时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/403/description
msgid ""
"The request could not be completed. Refer to the response body for details."
msgstr "无法完成该请求。详情请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/description
msgid ""
"This API allows a reseller to get a child customer's service quota by "
"referencing its service quota ID."
msgstr "代理商可以通过此 API，按服务配额 ID 获取子客户的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/summary
msgid "Update a service quota by service quota ID"
msgstr "按服务配额 ID 修改服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/responses/200/description
msgid "The customer's quota was updated successfully."
msgstr "客户的配额已成功修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/description
msgid ""
"This API allows a reseller to update a child customer's service quota by "
"referencing its service quota ID."
msgstr "代理商可以通过此 API，按服务配额 ID 修改子客户的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "updateServiceQuotaBody"
msgstr "updateServiceQuotaBody"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid ""
"This object contains the fields of the service quota that can be updated."
msgstr "此对象包含服务配额中可修改的字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedCacheDirectives/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedCacheDirectives/description
msgid ""
"A list of [advanced Edge Logic directives](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives>) that are permitted to be used."
msgstr ""
"允许使用的[高级 Edge Logic 指令](</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives>)列"
"表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It represents the amount of traffic "
"valued in US dollars that is permitted to be used over a period of time  set "
"by the <i>usageLimitDays</i> field. For example, a value of 90 for "
"<i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the customer "
"can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over a 90 day period. The dollar "
"value is based on CDN Pro's default pricing.\n"
msgstr ""
"此设置适用于试用客户。它表示在 <i>usageLimitDays</i> 字段设定的时间段内允许使"
"用的流量额度（以美元计价）。例如，<i>usageLimitDays</i> 的值为 90、"
"<i>usageLimitDollar</i> 的值为 50，表示客户在 90 天内最多可以使用价值 50 美元"
"的总流量。美元金额基于 CDN Pro 的默认定价。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It is used to limit traffic use. It "
"represents the number of days over which the traffic amount designated by "
"the <i>usageLimitDollar</i> field can be used. For example, a value of 90 "
"for <i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the "
"customer can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over a 90 day period.\n"
msgstr ""
"此设置适用于试用客户，用于限制流量使用。它表示可以使用 <i>usageLimitDollar</"
"i> 字段所指定流量额度的天数。例如，<i>usageLimitDays</i> 的值为 90、"
"<i>usageLimitDollar</i> 的值为 50，表示客户在 90 天内最多可以使用价值 50 美元"
"的总流量。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
msgid ""
"Whether the domain has ICP Beian which is required for content to be hosted "
"on servers in China. If set to true, every property's hostname that points "
"to an edge hostname using this domain must have ICP Beian."
msgstr ""
"该域名是否已有 ICP 备案（在中国境内的服务器上托管内容需要 ICP 备案）。如果设"
"置为 true，则加速项目中每个指向使用此域名的调度域名的加速域名都必须有 ICP 备"
"案。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
msgid ""
"List of server groups the customer is permitted to use. This can be used to "
"manage costs. Access to a higher level server group includes access to lower "
"level groups. In particular, <i>ultra</i> includes <i>standard</i>, "
"<i>premium</i>, and <i>deluxe</i>; <i>deluxe</i> includes <i>premium</i> and "
"<i>standard</i>; <i>premium</i> includes <i>standard</i>; and "
"<i>ChinaPremium</i> includes <i>ChinaStandard</i>."
msgstr ""
"允许客户使用的节点组列表，可用于管理成本。拥有较高级别节点组的使用权限即包含"
"较低级别节点组的使用权限。具体而言，<i>ultra</i> 包含 <i>standard</i>、"
"<i>premium</i> 和 <i>deluxe</i>；<i>deluxe</i> 包含 <i>premium</i> 和 "
"<i>standard</i>；<i>premium</i> 包含 <i>standard</i>；<i>ChinaPremium</i> 包"
"含 <i>ChinaStandard</i>。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid ""
"Include the fields that you wish to update. Omitted fields will not be "
"changed."
msgstr "请包含您希望修改的字段。省略的字段不会被更改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete a service quota by service quota ID"
msgstr "按服务配额 ID 删除服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/delete/responses/204/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid "The service quota was successfully deleted."
msgstr "服务配额已成功删除。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/delete/responses/403/description
msgid "The request is forbidden. Refer to the response body for details."
msgstr "该请求被禁止。详情请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/delete/responses/409/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/delete/responses/409/description
msgid ""
"The service quota cannot be deleted due to a conflict. Refer to the response "
"body for details."
msgstr "由于存在冲突，无法删除该服务配额。详情请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/delete/description
msgid ""
"This API allows a reseller to delete a child customer's service quota by "
"referencing its service quota ID. The deletion will only work if the "
"customer does not have any properties, certificates, or edge hostnames <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management/createdeployment\">deployed</a> in the "
"staging or production environments."
msgstr ""
"代理商可以通过此 API，按服务配额 ID 删除子客户的服务配额。只有当该客户在演练"
"环境或生产环境中没有任何已<a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management/"
"createdeployment\">部署</a>的加速项目、证书或调度域名时，删除操作才会成功。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginReq/post/summary
msgid "Get origin fast route requests"
msgstr "获取回源快速通道请求数"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginReq/post/description
msgid ""
"Return the number of requests to your origin server that uses our [fast "
"route feature](</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#origin_fast_route>) to "
"make the connections faster and more reliable."
msgstr ""
"返回使用我们的[快速通道功能](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#origin_fast_route>)发往您源站服务器的请求数，该功能可使连接更快、"
"更可靠。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginReq/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
msgid "Filters limit the results that are returned."
msgstr "过滤条件用于限定返回的结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginReq/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/propertyIds/description
msgid ""
"IDs of properties for which to return data. If unspecified, data for all "
"properties will be "
msgstr "要返回其数据的加速项目的 ID。如果未指定，将返回所有加速项目的数据"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/summary
msgid "Get origin fast route traffic volume"
msgstr "获取回源快速通道流量"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataUnit/description
msgid "Unit of measurement."
msgstr "计量单位。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataSeries/description
msgid ""
"The data points for the time period include the upload and download traffic."
msgstr "该时间段内的数据点，包括上传和下载流量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataSeries/items/description
msgid "Describes upload and download traffic for a particular timestamp."
msgstr "描述某个时间戳的上传和下载流量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataSeries/items/properties/timestamp/description
msgid ""
"An RFC 3339 format date representing the beginning of  a time interval. It "
"is always in <b>UTC</b> time. For example:  <code>\"timestamp\": "
"\"2019-10-29T01:00:00Z\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示一个时间区间的开始时间，始终为 <b>UTC</b> 时间。例"
"如：<code>\"timestamp\": \"2019-10-29T01:00:00Z\"</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataSeries/items/properties/dataUp/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the amount of traffic in megabytes uploaded to the origin using "
"the fast route feature."
msgstr "表示通过回源快速通道功能上传到源站的流量（单位：MB）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dataSeries/items/properties/dataDown/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the amount of traffic in megabytes downloaded from the origin "
"using the fast route feature."
msgstr "表示通过回源快速通道功能从源站下载的流量（单位：MB）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/description
msgid ""
"Return the traffic to your origin server that uses our [fast route feature]"
"(</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#origin_fast_route>) to make the "
"connections faster and more reliable."
msgstr ""
"返回使用我们的[快速通道功能](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#origin_fast_route>)发往您源站服务器的流量，该功能可使连接更快、更"
"可靠。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1fastOriginVol/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/hostnames/description
msgid ""
"List of hostnames for which to return data. The hostnames are the values of "
"the Host header sent by clients making requests for content. Wildcard "
"hostnames such as *.domain.com are also permitted. If unspecified, data from "
"all hostnames will be returned."
msgstr ""
"要返回其数据的加速域名列表。加速域名即客户端请求内容时发送的 Host 头的值。也"
"允许使用 *.domain.com 这样的通配符域名。如果未指定，将返回所有加速域名的数"
"据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"ID of a customer.  For the \"Get the service quota for a customer\" API, its "
"value can also be <i>me</i> to fetch your own service quota settings. You "
"cannot specify \"me\" to update or delete your own settings."
msgstr ""
"客户的 ID。对于“获取客户的服务配额”API，其值也可以为 <i>me</i>，以获取您自己"
"的服务配额设置。您不能指定 \"me\" 来修改或删除您自己的设置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/summary
msgid "Get the service quota for a customer"
msgstr "获取客户的服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/404/description
msgid ""
"No service quota was explicitly defined for this customer. The response body "
"will contain the default settings."
msgstr "未为该客户明确定义服务配额。响应体将包含默认设置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/description
msgid "Get the CDN service quota for a customer."
msgstr "获取客户的 CDN 服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/summary
msgid "Update the service quota for a customer"
msgstr "修改客户的服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/description
msgid ""
"This API allows a reseller to update an existing service quota for a child "
"customer."
msgstr "代理商可以通过此 API 修改子客户现有的服务配额。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete the service quota for a customer"
msgstr "删除客户的服务配额"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/delete/description
msgid ""
"This API allows a reseller to remove a service quota object for a child "
"customer. The deletion will only work if the customer does not have any "
"properties, certificates, or edge hostnames <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-"
"management/createdeployment\">deployed</a> in the staging or production "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"代理商可以通过此 API 删除子客户的服务配额对象。只有当该客户在演练环境或生产环"
"境中没有任何已<a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management/createdeployment\">部"
"署</a>的加速项目、证书或调度域名时，删除操作才会成功。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuTime/post/summary
msgid "Get CPU time used"
msgstr "获取 CPU 使用时间"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuTime/post/parameters/0/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/parameters/3/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/parameters/4/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include hostnames from the caller.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Only hostnames owned by children customers "
"will be included.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include data from "
"hostnames of both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选的请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</"
"th><th>行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>包含调用者的加速域名。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户拥有的加速域名。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的加速域名的数据。</"
"td></tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuTime/post/description
msgid ""
"Get the amount of CPU time in seconds used to handle requests for your "
"content."
msgstr "获取处理您内容请求所使用的 CPU 时间（单位：秒）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuTime/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
msgid ""
"Filter results by specifying hostnames, server groups, or property hostnames."
msgstr "通过指定加速域名、节点组或加速项目域名来过滤结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/summary
msgid "Get historical information about one hostname"
msgstr "获取单个加速域名的历史信息"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains details about the hostname."
msgstr "响应体包含该加速域名的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostname/description
msgid "A hostname that was defined in a property."
msgstr "在加速项目中定义的加速域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/description
msgid ""
"The history contains deployment and undeployment dates. It is empty if the "
"hostname has never been deployed to production."
msgstr ""
"历史记录包含部署和卸载日期。如果该加速域名从未部署到生产环境，则历史记录为"
"空。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/customerId/description
msgid "ID of the customer using the hostname."
msgstr "使用该加速域名的客户的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/propertyId/description
msgid "ID of the property that included the hostname."
msgstr "包含该加速域名的加速项目的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/deploymentDate/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date with UTC time that indicates when the property with the "
"hostname was deployed. Example: \"2020-04-24T20:09:15Z\""
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的 UTC 时间日期，表示包含该加速域名的加速项目的部署时间。示例："
"\"2020-04-24T20:09:15Z\""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/undeploymentDate/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date with UTC time that indicates when the property with the "
"hostname was undeployed. Example: \"2020-04-24T20:09:15Z\""
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的 UTC 时间日期，表示包含该加速域名的加速项目的卸载时间。示例："
"\"2020-04-24T20:09:15Z\""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/history/items/properties/target/description
msgid "Indicates where the property was deployed."
msgstr "表示加速项目部署到的位置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/description
msgid ""
"This API returns information about a hostname's deployments to production "
"and staging. Query parameters let you specify a timeframe to search and "
"where the hostname was deployed."
msgstr ""
"此 API 返回某个加速域名在生产环境和演练环境中的部署信息。您可以通过查询参数指"
"定要搜索的时间范围以及该加速域名的部署环境。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1hostnames~1historical~1{hostname}/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"Return historical information about deployments to a particular environment. "
"By default, information about deployments to both staging and production are "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"返回部署到特定环境的历史信息。默认同时返回部署到演练环境和生产环境的信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/summary
msgid "Create a prefetch request"
msgstr "创建预取请求"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The prefetch request was successfully created. The <i>Location</i> header "
"includes a reference to the prefetch request.  Call the <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"content-management/get-cdn-prefetches-id\">Get Prefetch Request status API</"
"a> to check its status. Example, <code>Location: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/prefetches/e91e8674-c2c5-4440-a1de-8b2ea99293dd</code>."
msgstr ""
"预取请求已成功创建。<i>Location</i> 头中包含对该预取请求的引用。请调用<a "
"href=\"/apidocs/content-management/get-cdn-prefetches-id\">获取预取请求状态 "
"API</a> 来查看其状态。示例：<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/"
"prefetches/e91e8674-c2c5-4440-a1de-8b2ea99293dd</code>。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL representing the new prefetch request. The URL follows this format: "
"https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/prefetches/{prefetchId} where {prefetchId} "
"represents the ID of the newly created prefetch request. If you would like "
"to get the request ID, simply extract the last portion of the path and "
"ignore the rest. "
msgstr ""
"表示新预取请求的 URL。URL 的格式为：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/"
"prefetches/{prefetchId}，其中 {prefetchId} 表示新建预取请求的 ID。如果您想获"
"取请求 ID，只需提取路径的最后一部分，忽略其余部分即可。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/responses/400/content/application~1json/schema/properties/code/description
msgid "An error code."
msgstr "错误码。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/responses/400/content/application~1json/schema/properties/message/description
msgid "An error message."
msgstr "错误消息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a prefetch request to warm up the CDN Pro cache with contents from "
"your origin in anticipation of visitors. This is helpful to prevent a sudden "
"influx of requests to your origin servers. The URLs you prefetch must be for "
"hostnames of properties deployed to production.\n"
msgstr ""
"创建预取请求，在访问者到来之前预先用源站内容填充 CDN Pro 缓存。这有助于避免大"
"量请求突然涌向您的源站服务器。您预取的 URL 必须属于已部署到生产环境的加速项目"
"的加速域名。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid "Enter a short description of the prefetch task."
msgstr "输入预取任务的简短描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/description
msgid "URLs to prefetch."
msgstr "要预取的 URL。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/items/properties/url/description
msgid ""
"A URL to prefetch. It must begin with 'http' or 'https' and can be up to "
"2048 characters.\n"
msgstr "要预取的 URL。必须以 'http' 或 'https' 开头，最长 2048 个字符。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/items/properties/headers/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/items/properties/headers/description
msgid ""
"If a URL's cache key depends on request headers, you can specify the header "
"values that are applicable to prefetch one version of the URL."
msgstr ""
"如果某个 URL 的缓存键取决于请求头，您可以指定适用的请求头值，以预取该 URL 的"
"某个版本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/regions/description
msgid ""
"A list of regions in which to perform the prefetch. Omitting the field means "
"the prefetch will be done by all regions' servers. \"Asia\" includes servers "
"in Mainland China."
msgstr ""
"执行预取的区域列表。省略此字段表示由所有区域的服务器执行预取。\"Asia\" 包括中"
"国大陆的服务器。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/startTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/startTime/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating when the prefetch should begin. This must be in UTC "
"time, for example, \"2021-03-06T00:00:00Z\"."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示预取的开始时间。必须为 UTC 时间，例如 "
"\"2021-03-06T00:00:00Z\"。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webhook/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webhook/description
msgid "ID of a webhook to call when the prefetch task completes."
msgstr "预取任务完成时要调用的 Webhook 的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/post/requestBody/description
msgid "Specify the URLs you wish to prefetch."
msgstr "指定您希望预取的 URL。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/summary
msgid "Get list of prefetch requests"
msgstr "获取预取请求列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response contains a list of prefetch requests."
msgstr "响应包含预取请求列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid ""
"Total number of prefetch requests matching the criteria specified in the "
"query parameters. The actual number of entries in prefetchRequests may be "
"fewer if you specified the parameter."
msgstr ""
"与查询参数中指定条件相匹配的预取请求总数。如果您指定了该参数，"
"prefetchRequests 中的实际条目数可能更少。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/description
msgid "List of prefetch requests."
msgstr "预取请求列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/id/description
msgid "prefetch request task ID.\n"
msgstr "预取请求任务 ID。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/name/description
msgid " a short description of the prefetch task."
msgstr "预取任务的简短描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/status/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/status/description
msgid "Indicates the status of the prefetch request."
msgstr "表示预取请求的状态。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/submissionTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/submissionTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the prefetch request was submitted."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示预取请求的提交时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/finishTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/finishTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the prefetch completed."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示预取的完成时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/successRate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/successRate/description
msgid "A percentage that indicates the completion of the prefetch request."
msgstr "表示预取请求完成进度的百分比。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/fileEntries/description
msgid "Number of URLs in the prefetch request."
msgstr "预取请求中的 URL 数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/hostnames/description
msgid "List of hostnames that were prefetched."
msgstr "已预取的加速域名列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/apiAccountId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/apiAccountId/description
msgid ""
"ID of the API account used to create the prefetch request. This value is "
"only set if the API account was created using our /ngadmin/apiAccounts <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/api-account-management/post-ngadmin-apiaccounts\">endpoint</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"用于创建该预取请求的 API 账号的 ID。仅当该 API 账号是通过我们的 /ngadmin/"
"apiAccounts <a href=\"/apidocs/api-account-management/post-ngadmin-"
"apiaccounts\">接口</a>创建时，才会设置此值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/ownerCustomerId/description
msgid ""
"ID of the customer that made the prefetch request. This field is present "
"only if the Report-Range header is children-only or self+children."
msgstr ""
"发起该预取请求的客户的 ID。仅当 Report-Range 头为 children-only 或 "
"self+children 时，才会包含此字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of prefetch requests. Prefetch records are retained for fifteen "
"days. Filter the list by specifying query parameters."
msgstr "获取预取请求列表。预取记录保留十五天。您可以通过指定查询参数筛选列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the beginning of the time period. It must be in UTC "
"time, for example, \"2021-03-01T01:00:00Z\"."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示时间段的开始时间。必须为 UTC 时间，例如 "
"\"2021-03-01T01:00:00Z\"。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time period. It must be in UTC time, "
"for example, \"2021-03-01T01:00:00Z\"."
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示时间段的结束时间。必须为 UTC 时间，例如 "
"\"2021-03-01T01:00:00Z\"。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/2/description
msgid "Index of the first prefetch request to return."
msgstr "要返回的第一个预取请求的索引。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/3/description
msgid "Maximum number of prefetch requests to return."
msgstr "要返回的预取请求的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"Controls the order in which prefetch requests are returned. The default is "
"to return the most recently submitted request first."
msgstr "控制预取请求的返回顺序。默认先返回最近提交的请求。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/5/description
msgid ""
"Order of prefetch requests. The default is to return the most recent "
"prefetch request first. Enter 'asc' for ascending order or 'desc' for "
"descending order."
msgstr ""
"预取请求的排序方式。默认先返回最近的预取请求。输入 'asc' 表示升序，输入 "
"'desc' 表示降序。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/6/description
msgid ""
"The value will be used to match on prefetch request names, hostnames, and "
"the task IDs to limit the prefetch requests that are returned."
msgstr "该值将用于匹配预取请求名称、加速域名和任务 ID，以限定返回的预取请求。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/7/description
msgid ""
"If you are a reseller, you can use this header to specify the ID of a child "
"customer. Only requests from that customer will be returned. "
msgstr ""
"如果您是代理商，可以使用此请求头指定某个子客户的 ID。仅返回该客户的请求。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/parameters/8/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include prefetch requests by the caller only.</"
"td></tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Include prefetch requests by children "
"customers only.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include prefetch "
"requests by both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选的请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</"
"th><th>行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>仅包含调用者的预取请求。</"
"td></tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户的预取请求。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的预取请求。</td></"
"tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/parameters/0/description
msgid "ID of a prefetch request."
msgstr "预取请求的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/summary
msgid "Get prefetch request status"
msgstr "获取预取请求状态"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a summary of the prefetch request."
msgstr "响应体包含该预取请求的摘要。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid "A short description of the prefetch task."
msgstr "预取任务的简短描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/fileList/items/properties/url/description
msgid ""
"A URL to prefetch. It must begin with 'http' or 'https' and can be up to "
"2048 characters."
msgstr "要预取的 URL。必须以 'http' 或 'https' 开头，长度不超过 2048 个字符。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/description
msgid "Details about the prefetch request's status."
msgstr "预取请求状态的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/id/description
msgid "ID of the prefetch request."
msgstr "预取请求的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/apiName/description
msgid ""
"Name of API account which created this prefetch request. If a reseller "
"created the request on behalf of a child customer, it is the API account "
"name of the reseller."
msgstr ""
"创建此预取请求的 API 账号名称。如果是代理商代表子客户创建的请求，则为代理商"
"的 API 账号名称。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/customerId/description
msgid "ID of the customer whose URLs are prefetched."
msgstr "被预取 URL 所属客户的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/impersonatingParentCustomerId/description
msgid ""
"If a reseller performs a prefetch on behalf of a child customer, this field "
"will be present and indicate the reseller's ID."
msgstr "如果是代理商代表子客户执行预取，则会返回此字段，表示代理商的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/regions/description
msgid ""
"A list of continents representing the regions in which to perform the "
"prefetch. Omitting the field means the prefetch will be done by all regions' "
"servers. \"Asia\" includes servers in Mainland China."
msgstr ""
"表示执行预取的区域的大洲列表。省略此字段表示由所有区域的服务器执行预取。"
"\"Asia\" 包括中国大陆的服务器。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchLevel/description
msgid ""
"CDN Pro servers that will perform the prefetch. The default, <i>Parent</i>, "
"results in parent nodes of the CDN prefetching content."
msgstr ""
"执行预取的 CDN Pro 服务器。默认值 <i>Parent</i> 表示由 CDN 的父节点预取内容。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/description
msgid "Get details on the status of a prefetch request."
msgstr "获取预取请求状态的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/summary
msgid "Create an API permission"
msgstr "创建 API 权限"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The API permission was successfully created. A Location header containing "
"the URL of the API permissions is returned. Example: <code>Location: https://"
"ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/apiPermissions/12</code>"
msgstr ""
"API 权限创建成功。返回的 Location 头中包含该 API 权限的 URL。示例："
"<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/apiPermissions/12</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL to the API account's permissions. The URL follows this format: https://"
"ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/apiPermissions/{accountId} where {accountId} "
"represents the ID of the API account. If you would like to get the account "
"ID, simply extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest.  You "
"can use the ID to create, update, or delete the API permissions."
msgstr ""
"API 账号权限的 URL。URL 格式为：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/"
"apiPermissions/{accountId}，其中 {accountId} 表示 API 账号的 ID。如需获取账"
"号 ID，只需提取路径的最后一段，忽略其余部分。您可以使用该 ID 创建、修改或删"
"除 API 权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/description
msgid ""
"Control which CDN endpoints an <a href=\"/apidocs/api-account-management/"
"post-ngadmin-apiaccounts\">API account</a> can access. The permissions work "
"with the API account's type, <i>operator</i> or <i>read-only</i>. For "
"example, for security, you can limit a read-only API account to the property "
"management APIs. This would allow the API account to see your property "
"configurations but not make changes to them; it would not be permitted to "
"call other APIs. \n"
"\n"
"You must call this API to create permissions for each new API account before "
"it can be used. After you create a custom API permission for the API "
"account, you can update its permissions further by calling our <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/api-access-control/patch-cdn-apipermissions-id\">update permission "
"API</a>."
msgstr ""
"控制 <a href=\"/apidocs/api-account-management/post-ngadmin-"
"apiaccounts\">API 账号</a>可以访问哪些 CDN 接口。这些权限与 API 账号的类型"
"（<i>operator</i> 或 <i>read-only</i>）配合使用。例如，出于安全考虑，您可以"
"将 read-only API 账号限制为只能使用加速项目管理 API。这样，该 API 账号可以查"
"看您的加速项目配置，但不能修改，也不允许调用其他 API。\n"
"\n"
"每个新 API 账号在使用之前，您都必须调用此 API 为其创建权限。为 API 账号创建自"
"定义 API 权限后，您可以调用<a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control/patch-cdn-"
"apipermissions-id\">修改权限 API</a> 进一步修改其权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"If you are a reseller, you can use this header to specify the ID of a child "
"customer for which you are creating an API permission."
msgstr "如果您是代理商，可以使用此请求头指定要为其创建 API 权限的子客户 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/description
msgid ""
"Customize the access given to the API account. Unspecified fields will be "
"given default values."
msgstr "自定义授予 API 账号的访问权限。未指定的字段将使用默认值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/certificates/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/certificates/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/certificates/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-"
"management\">certificate management</a> (/cdn/certificates) endpoints. The "
"value 'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to "
"getting the list of certificates or a certificate's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-management\">证书管理</a>"
"（/cdn/certificates）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为"
"只能获取证书列表或证书详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/properties/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/properties/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/properties/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"management\">property management</a> (/cdn/properties) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of properties or a property's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/property-management\">加速项目管理</a>"
"（/cdn/properties）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取加速项目列表或加速项目详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/edgeHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/edgeHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/edgeHostnames/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/edge-hostname-"
"management\">edge hostname management</a> (/cdn/edgeHostnames) endpoints. "
"The value 'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to "
"getting the list of edge hostnames or an edge hostname's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/edge-hostname-management\">调度域名管"
"理</a>（/cdn/edgeHostnames）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其"
"限制为只能获取调度域名列表或调度域名详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/validations/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/validations/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"validation\">property validation</a> (/cdn/validations) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of validation tasks or a validation task's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/property-validation\">加速项目验证</a>"
"（/cdn/validations）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取验证任务列表或验证任务详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/deploymentTasks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/deploymentTasks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/deploymentTasks/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can deploy properties and certificates to staging, "
"production, both staging and production, or not at all using the <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/deployment-management\">deployment management</a> (/cdn/"
"deploymentTasks) endpoints. The value 'read' can be given to an operator API "
"account to restrict it to getting the list of deployment tasks or a "
"deployment task's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以使用<a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management\">部署管理</a>"
"（/cdn/deploymentTasks）接口将加速项目和证书部署到演练环境、生产环境、同时部"
"署到演练环境和生产环境，或完全不能部署。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 "
"'read'，将其限制为只能获取部署任务列表或部署任务详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/purges/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/purges/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"createpurge\">purge</a> (/cdn/purges) endpoints. The value 'read' can be "
"given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the list of purge "
"requests or a purge request's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">刷新"
"</a>（/cdn/purges）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取刷新请求列表或刷新请求详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/prefetches/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"post-cdn-prefetches\">prefetch</a> (/cdn/prefetches) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of prefetch requests or a prefetch request's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/post-cdn-"
"prefetches\">预取</a>（/cdn/prefetches）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 "
"'read'，将其限制为只能获取预取请求列表或预取请求详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/annotations/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/annotations/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/annotations/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/annotations-for-"
"reports\">report annotations</a> (/cdn/annotations) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of annotations or an annotation's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/annotations-for-reports\">报表注释</a>"
"（/cdn/annotations）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取注释列表或注释详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/apiPermissions/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-"
"control\">API permission</a> (/cdn/apiPermissions) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting an "
"API permission's details. An operator API account with this permission set "
"to 'true' cannot, in turn, grant it to another API account under the same "
"customer though it can manage other permissions. A reseller's operator API "
"account could manage this permission on behalf of child customers' API "
"accounts though."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control\">API 权限</a>（/"
"cdn/apiPermissions）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取 API 权限详情。此权限设置为 'true' 的 operator API 账号虽然可以管理其他"
"权限，但不能再将此权限授予同一客户下的其他 API 账号。不过，代理商的 operator "
"API 账号可以代表子客户的 API 账号管理此权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/systemConfigs/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/systemConfigs/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/systemConfigs/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-"
"management/get-cdn-systemconfigs\">system configuration</a> (/cdn/"
"systemConfigs) endpoint."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-"
"systemconfigs\">系统配置</a>（/cdn/systemConfigs）接口。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/reports/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/reports/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/reports/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/reports\">reports</"
"a> (/cdn/report) endpoints."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/reports\">报表</a>（/cdn/report）接"
"口。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/serviceQuotas/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/serviceQuotas/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/serviceQuotas/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-"
"management/post-cdn-servicequotas\">service quotas</a> (/cdn/serviceQuotas) "
"endpoints. The value 'read' can be given to an operator API account to "
"restrict it to getting the list of service quotas or a service quota's "
"details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/post-cdn-"
"servicequotas\">服务配额</a>（/cdn/serviceQuotas）接口。可以为 operator API "
"账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只能获取服务配额列表或服务配额详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/hostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/hostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/hostnames/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"hostnames\">hostnames</a> (/cdn/hostnames) endpoints.\n"
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/hostnames\">加速域名</a>（/cdn/"
"hostnames）接口。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/webhooks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/webhooks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/webhooks/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"webhooks\">webhooks</a> (/cdn/webhooks) endpoints. The value 'read' can be "
"given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the list of "
"webhooks or a webhook's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问 <a href=\"/apidocs/webhooks\">Webhook</a>（/cdn/"
"webhooks）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只能获取 "
"Webhook 列表或 Webhook 详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/secret-"
"management\">secret management</a> (/cdn/secrets) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of secrets or a secret's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/secret-management\">保密信息管理</a>"
"（/cdn/secrets）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只能获"
"取保密信息列表或保密信息详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/logConfigs/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/logConfigs/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/log-configuration-"
"management\">log configuration</a> (/cdn/logConfigs) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of log configurations or a log configuration's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/log-configuration-management\">日志配"
"置</a>（/cdn/logConfigs）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限"
"制为只能获取日志配置列表或日志配置详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/description
msgid ""
"List of IDs of resources that can be accessed. This works with "
"<i>allowedOperations</i>. For example, suppose "
"allowedOperations.certificates is set to <i>true</i>. If "
"allowedResources.certificates is not specified, then all certificates are "
"accessible. However, if allowedResources.certificates is specified, then "
"access is restricted to the listed certificates. If the list is empty, no "
"certificates are accessible."
msgstr ""
"可访问的资源 ID 列表。此字段与 <i>allowedOperations</i> 配合使用。例如，假设 "
"allowedOperations.certificates 设置为 <i>true</i>：如果未指定 "
"allowedResources.certificates，则所有证书均可访问；如果指定了 "
"allowedResources.certificates，则只能访问列出的证书；如果列表为空，则无法访问"
"任何证书。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/certificates/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/certificates/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/certificates/description
msgid "IDs of certificates that can be accessed."
msgstr "可访问的证书 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/properties/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/properties/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/properties/description
msgid ""
"IDs of properties that can be accessed. If you specify property IDs in this "
"field, property management endpoints are limited to the accessible "
"properties. In addition, because hostnames are specified in property "
"definitions, any restrictions on properties also limit the hostnames that "
"are accessible through other API endpoints including reports, log "
"configuration management, hostnames, and content management. For example, "
"calls to the <a href=\"/apidocs/hostnames\">hostnames</a> (/cdn/hostnames) "
"endpoints will return information about hostnames only if they belong to the "
"list of allowed properties. Similarly, the <a href=\"/apidocs/"
"reports\">reports</a> (/cdn/report) endpoints will return data only for "
"hostnames belonging to the allowed properties."
msgstr ""
"可访问的加速项目 ID。如果在此字段中指定了加速项目 ID，则加速项目管理接口仅限"
"于访问这些加速项目。此外，由于加速域名是在加速项目定义中指定的，对加速项目的"
"任何限制也会限制通过其他 API 接口（包括报表、日志配置管理、加速域名和内容管"
"理）可访问的加速域名。例如，调用<a href=\"/apidocs/hostnames\">加速域名</a>"
"（/cdn/hostnames）接口时，仅当加速域名属于允许的加速项目时才会返回其信息。同"
"样，<a href=\"/apidocs/reports\">报表</a>（/cdn/report）接口仅返回属于允许的"
"加速项目的加速域名的数据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/edgeHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/edgeHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/edgeHostnames/description
msgid "Edge hostnames that can be accessed."
msgstr "可访问的调度域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/webhooks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/webhooks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/webhooks/description
msgid "IDs of webhooks that can be accessed."
msgstr "可访问的 Webhook ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedResources/properties/secrets/description
msgid "IDs of secrets that can be accessed."
msgstr "可访问的保密信息 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/description
msgid "Customize the access permitted to an API account."
msgstr "自定义 API 账号的访问权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/summary
msgid "Get an API permission"
msgstr "获取 API 权限"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains the API account's permissions."
msgstr "响应体包含该 API 账号的权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/description
msgid ""
"This object contains the permissions given to the API account. Fields "
"without custom settings will be given default values."
msgstr "此对象包含授予该 API 账号的权限。未自定义设置的字段将使用默认值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/validations/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"validation\">property validation </a> (/cdn/validations) endpoints. The "
"value 'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to "
"getting the list of validation tasks or a validation task's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/property-validation\">加速项目验证 </"
"a>（/cdn/validations）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为"
"只能获取验证任务列表或验证任务详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/prefetches/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/prefetches/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"post-cdn-prefetches\">prefetch</a>   (/cdn/prefetches) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the "
"list of prefetch requests or a prefetch request's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/post-cdn-"
"prefetches\">预取</a>（/cdn/prefetches）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 "
"'read'，将其限制为只能获取预取请求列表或预取请求详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/apiPermissions/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-"
"control\">API permissions</a> (/cdn/apiPermissions) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting an "
"API permission's details. An operator API account with this permission set "
"to 'true' cannot, in turn, grant it to another API account under the same "
"customer though it can manage other permissions. A reseller's operator API "
"account could manage this permission on behalf of child customers' API "
"accounts though."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control\">API 权限</a>（/"
"cdn/apiPermissions）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取 API 权限详情。此权限设置为 'true' 的 operator API 账号虽然可以管理其他"
"权限，但不能再将此权限授予同一客户下的其他 API 账号。不过，代理商的 operator "
"API 账号可以代表子客户的 API 账号管理此权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/code/description
msgid ""
"Error code if there is a problem with the API call. It would be returned "
"along with a <i>message</i> field."
msgstr "API 调用出现问题时返回的错误码，会与 <i>message</i> 字段一起返回。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/404/content/application~1json/schema/properties/message/description
msgid ""
"An error message if there is a problem with the API call. It would be "
"returned along with a <i>code</i> field."
msgstr "API 调用出现问题时返回的错误信息，会与 <i>code</i> 字段一起返回。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/description
msgid ""
"Return an API account's permissions, both custom ones as well as the "
"defaults. If you have not set an API account's permissions, you will get a "
"404 HTTP response. To specify the permissions of a new API account, you must "
"<a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control/post-cdn-apipermissions\">create an "
"API permission</a> object for your API account with custom settings. Later, "
"you can call our <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control/patch-cdn-"
"apipermissions-id\">API to modify the permissions</a> further if needed."
msgstr ""
"返回 API 账号的权限，包括自定义权限和默认权限。如果您尚未设置 API 账号的权"
"限，将收到 404 HTTP 响应。要为新 API 账号指定权限，您必须为该 API 账号<a "
"href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control/post-cdn-apipermissions\">创建 API 权限</"
"a>对象并进行自定义设置。之后如有需要，您可以调用<a href=\"/apidocs/api-"
"access-control/patch-cdn-apipermissions-id\">修改权限的 API</a> 做进一步修"
"改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/summary
msgid "Update an API permission"
msgstr "修改 API 权限"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/responses/204/description
msgid "The account's API permissions were updated."
msgstr "账号的 API 权限已修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/responses/400/description
msgid "The request was invalid. Refer to the response body."
msgstr "请求无效，请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/responses/404/description
msgid "The API account could not be found."
msgstr "找不到该 API 账号。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/description
msgid ""
"Update permissions for an API account. If you have not yet customized the "
"permissions of an API account, you must first <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-"
"control/post-cdn-apipermissions\">create a custom API permission</a>. "
"Otherwise, this API will return a 404 response."
msgstr ""
"修改 API 账号的权限。如果您尚未自定义 API 账号的权限，必须先<a href=\"/"
"apidocs/api-access-control/post-cdn-apipermissions\">创建自定义 API 权限</"
"a>，否则此 API 将返回 404 响应。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/purges/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"createpurge\">purge</a>  (/cdn/purges) endpoints. The value 'read' can be "
"given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting the list of purge "
"requests or a purge request's details."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">刷新"
"</a>（/cdn/purges）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取刷新请求列表或刷新请求详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/apiPermissions/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-"
"control\">API permissions</a>  (/cdn/apiPermissions) endpoints. The value "
"'read' can be given to an operator API account to restrict it to getting an "
"API permission's details. An operator API account with this permission set "
"to 'true' cannot, in turn, grant it to another API account under the same "
"customer though it can manage other permissions. A reseller's operator API "
"account could manage this permission on behalf of child customers' API "
"accounts though."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control\">API 权限</a>（/"
"cdn/apiPermissions）接口。可以为 operator API 账号指定值 'read'，将其限制为只"
"能获取 API 权限详情。此权限设置为 'true' 的 operator API 账号虽然可以管理其他"
"权限，但不能再将此权限授予同一客户下的其他 API 账号。不过，代理商的 operator "
"API 账号可以代表子客户的 API 账号管理此权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/logConfigs/description
msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"/apidocs/log-configuration-"
"management\">log configuration</a> (/cdn/logConfigs) endpoints."
msgstr ""
"API 账号是否可以访问<a href=\"/apidocs/log-configuration-management\">日志配"
"置</a>（/cdn/logConfigs）接口。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid "Specify the permissions to update."
msgstr "指定要修改的权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete an API permission"
msgstr "删除 API 权限"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid ""
"The API account's custom permissions were removed. This does not remove the "
"API account itself. The API account still has default permissions."
msgstr ""
"API 账号的自定义权限已移除。这不会删除 API 账号本身，该 API 账号仍具有默认权"
"限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/delete/description
msgid "Delete custom permissions for an API account."
msgstr "删除 API 账号的自定义权限。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of requests"
msgstr "获取请求数汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of requests by group. It can contain up to "
"10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value of "
"\"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains "
"the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. When "
"\"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含按分组统计的请求数汇总，最多包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 10000 "
"个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所有分组"
"（包括超出 10000 个限制的分组）的总计。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总计等"
"于其他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "requestSummaryResponse"
msgstr "requestSummaryResponse"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of data returned. \n"
"<table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td>edge request</"
"td><td>requests to edge servers</td></tr><tr><td>fast route request</"
"td><td>requests to your origin accelerated through the HDT product</td></"
"tr><tr><td>intermediate request</td><td>requests between CDN Pro servers</"
"td></tr><tr><td>origin request</td><td>requests to your origin server</td></"
"tr></table> The order of the entries in the <i>dataNames</i> array "
"corresponds to the order of values returned in the <i>data</i> array in the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"表示返回数据的类型。\n"
"<table><tr><th>名称</th><th>描述</th></tr><tr><td>edge request</td><td>发往边"
"缘服务器的请求</td></tr><tr><td>fast route request</td><td>经由 HDT 产品加速"
"发往您源站的请求</td></tr><tr><td>intermediate request</td><td>CDN Pro 服务器"
"之间的请求</td></tr><tr><td>origin request</td><td>发往您源站服务器的请求</"
"td></tr></table> <i>dataNames</i> 数组中各项的顺序与响应中 <i>data</i> 数组中"
"返回值的顺序一致。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid "This object contains the breakdown of requests by group."
msgstr "此对象包含按分组细分的请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/items/properties/group/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/items/properties/group/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/items/properties/group/description
#. (+5 more)
msgid ""
"Name of a group.  \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" is a special group encompassing all "
"groups."
msgstr "分组名称。\"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 是包含所有分组的特殊分组。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of requests during a time period. You can filter and group "
"results by hostnames, server groups, property IDs, or property hostnames. If "
"you are a reseller, you can also filter and group by customerIds to "
"distinguish your child customers' requests."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内的请求数汇总。您可以按加速域名、节点组、加速项目 ID 或加速项目"
"的加速域名筛选和分组结果。如果您是代理商，还可以按 customerIds 筛选和分组，以"
"区分各子客户的请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/parameters/2/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/parameters/2/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2019-11-14T00:00:00Z</code> Your enddate may be rounded up to "
"the nearest minute, hour, or day depending on the <i>type</i> parameter. For "
"example, if you enter <code>enddate=2019-09-05T03:14:01Z&type=hourly</code>, "
"the response includes data ending 2019-09-05T04:00:00Z. Due to latency "
"associated with new traffic data, enddate should be no later than five "
"minutes before the current time. This ensures you get the most accurate "
"results."
msgstr ""
"表示时间段结束时间的 RFC 3339 日期。时间必须使用 UTC 时区指定，不能使用时区偏"
"移。示例：<code>enddate=2019-11-14T00:00:00Z</code> 根据 <i>type</i> 参数的不"
"同，您的 enddate 可能会向上取整到最接近的分钟、小时或天。例如，如果您输入 "
"<code>enddate=2019-09-05T03:14:01Z&type=hourly</code>，响应中的数据将截止到 "
"2019-09-05T04:00:00Z。由于新流量数据存在延迟，enddate 应不晚于当前时间前五分"
"钟，以确保您获得最准确的结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/parameters/2/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/parameters/3/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/parameters/2/description
#. (+5 more)
msgid ""
"Limit the results to the specified scheme. By default, data from HTTPS and "
"HTTP requests is returned."
msgstr "将结果限定为指定的协议。默认返回 HTTPS 和 HTTP 请求的数据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of requests during a time period. Query parameters let you "
"specify the time period, scheme, and whether to group the results. If you "
"are a reseller, you can also group by customerIds to distinguish your child "
"customers' requests."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内的请求数汇总。您可以通过查询参数指定时间段、协议以及是否对结果"
"分组。如果您是代理商，还可以按 customerIds 分组，以区分各子客户的请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'serverGroups', 'customerIds', 'propertyHostnames',  'propertyIds', and "
"'legacyTypes' by specifying a comma-separated list of the keywords."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 "
"'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds'、'propertyHostnames'、'propertyIds' "
"和 'legacyTypes' 中最多两个的任意组合对结果进行分组，方法是指定以逗号分隔的关"
"键字列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of webhooks"
msgstr "获取 Webhook 列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a list of webhooks."
msgstr "响应体包含 Webhook 列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid ""
"Total number of webhooks. The number returned in the webhooks array may be "
"fewer depending on your query parameters."
msgstr "Webhook 总数。根据查询参数的不同，webhooks 数组中返回的数量可能更少。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/description
msgid "A list of webhooks"
msgstr "Webhook 列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/description
msgid "List of webhooks."
msgstr "Webhook 列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/customerId/description
msgid "Refers to a customer."
msgstr "指代一个客户。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/id/description
msgid "ID of the webhook."
msgstr "Webhook 的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "Name of the webhook."
msgstr "Webhook 的名称。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
msgid "An optional description of the webhook."
msgstr "Webhook 的描述（可选）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/creationTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the webhook was created."
msgstr "表示 Webhook 创建时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/lastUpdatetime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the webhook was last updated."
msgstr "表示 Webhook 最后修改时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/lastCallTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the webhook was last called."
msgstr "表示 Webhook 最后一次被调用时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/totalCalls/description
msgid "Total number of times the webhook has been called."
msgstr "Webhook 被调用的总次数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/webooks/items/properties/hasCredentials/description
msgid "Whether the webhook requires credentials to access."
msgstr "访问该 Webhook 是否需要凭据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/responses/400/description
msgid "The request was invaild. Refer to the response body for details."
msgstr "请求无效。详情请参阅响应体。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of webhooks that have been defined. You can reference a webhook "
"when <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management/createdeployment\">creating a "
"deployment task</a>, <a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"createpurge\">creating a purge request</a>, <a href=\"/apidocs/content-"
"management/post-cdn-prefetches\">creating a prefetch request</a>, or <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/property-validation/createvalidationtask\">creating a "
"validation task</a>."
msgstr ""
"获取已定义的 Webhook 列表。您可以在<a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management/"
"createdeployment\">创建部署任务</a>、<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/"
"createpurge\">创建刷新请求</a>、<a href=\"/apidocs/content-management/post-"
"cdn-prefetches\">创建预取请求</a>或<a href=\"/apidocs/property-validation/"
"createvalidationtask\">创建验证任务</a>时引用 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/parameters/0/description
msgid "Index of the first webhook to return."
msgstr "要返回的第一个 Webhook 的索引。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/parameters/1/description
msgid "Maximum number of webhooks to return."
msgstr "要返回的 Webhook 的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/get/parameters/2/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Return webhooks of the caller only.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Include webhooks of children customers only."
"</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include webhooks of both the caller "
"and children customers.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</th><th>"
"行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>仅返回调用者自己的 Webhook。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户的 Webhook。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的 Webhook。</td></"
"tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/summary
msgid "Create a webhook"
msgstr "创建 Webhook"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The webhook was successfully created. A Location header containing the URL "
"of the new webhook is returned. Example: <code>Location: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/webhooks/60a2e69806d5583a81ad9500</code>"
msgstr ""
"Webhook 创建成功。返回的 Location 头中包含新 Webhook 的 URL。示例："
"<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/webhooks/"
"60a2e69806d5583a81ad9500</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL to the new webhook. The URL follows this format: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/webhooks/{webhookId} where {webhookId} represents the ID "
"of the webhook. If you would like to get the webhook ID, simply extract the "
"last portion of the path and ignore the rest. You can use the ID to create, "
"update, or delete the webhook."
msgstr ""
"新 Webhook 的 URL。URL 格式为：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/webhooks/"
"{webhookId}，其中 {webhookId} 表示 Webhook 的 ID。如需获取 Webhook ID，只需提"
"取路径的最后一段，忽略其余部分。您可以使用该 ID 创建、修改或删除 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a webhook. It can be used to notify you when an asynchronous task "
"completes. You can reference a webhook when <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-"
"management/createdeployment\">creating a deployment task</a>, <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">creating a purge request</a>, <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/content-management/post-cdn-prefetches\">creating a prefetch "
"request</a>, or <a href=\"/apidocs/property-validation/"
"createvalidationtask\">creating a validation task</a>."
msgstr ""
"创建 Webhook。Webhook 可用于在异步任务完成时通知您。您可以在<a href=\"/"
"apidocs/deployment-management/createdeployment\">创建部署任务</a>、<a "
"href=\"/apidocs/content-management/createpurge\">创建刷新请求</a>、<a "
"href=\"/apidocs/content-management/post-cdn-prefetches\">创建预取请求</a>或"
"<a href=\"/apidocs/property-validation/createvalidationtask\">创建验证任务</"
"a>时引用 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
msgid "Optional description of the webhook."
msgstr "Webhook 的描述（可选）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/url/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/url/description
msgid ""
"That URL that will be called when the asynchronous task has completed. The "
"HTTP POST method will be used. The body will in JSON format:\n"
"<code>\n"
"{ \"subject\": \"{some text}\",\n"
"  \"taskType\": \"{task type}\",\n"
"  \"taskList\": [\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 1}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    },\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 2}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"</code>"
msgstr ""
"异步任务完成时将调用的 URL。调用使用 HTTP POST 方法，请求体为 JSON 格式：\n"
"<code>\n"
"{ \"subject\": \"{some text}\",\n"
"  \"taskType\": \"{task type}\",\n"
"  \"taskList\": [\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 1}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    },\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 2}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/description
msgid ""
"Optional credentials passed to the URL. If requiring credentials your server "
"should support HTTP Basic authentication the same way we do. Refer to <a "
"href=\"/apidocs\">Authentication summary</a>. In particular, the "
"<i>password</i> will be the secretKey encoded with the current date."
msgstr ""
"传递给该 URL 的凭据（可选）。如果需要凭据，您的服务器应以与我们相同的方式支"
"持 HTTP Basic 认证，请参阅<a href=\"/apidocs\">认证概述</a>。特别是，"
"<i>password</i> 将是使用当前日期编码后的 secretKey。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/user/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/user/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/user/description
msgid "The username passed to the URL on your server."
msgstr "传递给您服务器上该 URL 的用户名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/secretKey/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/secretKey/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/credentials/properties/secretKey/description
msgid ""
"A string that is encoded with the date and passed in the Authorization "
"header to your server."
msgstr "使用日期编码后，在 Authorization 头中传递给您服务器的字符串。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks/post/requestBody/description
msgid "Specify information about the new webhook."
msgstr "指定新 Webhook 的信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/parameters/0/description
msgid "ID of a webhook"
msgstr "Webhook 的 ID"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/summary
msgid "Get a webhook"
msgstr "获取 Webhook"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains details about the webhook."
msgstr "响应体包含该 Webhook 的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/url/description
msgid ""
"That URL that will be called when the asynchronous task has completed. The "
"HTTP POST method will be used. The body will in JSON format:\n"
"<code>\n"
"{ \"subject\": \"{some text}\",\n"
"  \"taskType\": \"{task type}\",\n"
"  \"taskList\": [\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 1}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    },\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 2}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"</code>\n"
msgstr ""
"异步任务完成时将调用的 URL。调用使用 HTTP POST 方法，请求体为 JSON 格式：\n"
"<code>\n"
"{ \"subject\": \"{some text}\",\n"
"  \"taskType\": \"{task type}\",\n"
"  \"taskList\": [\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 1}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    },\n"
"    { \"taskId\": \"{task id 2}\",\n"
"      ...\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"</code>\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/lastCallTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the webhook was last called"
msgstr "表示 Webhook 最后一次被调用时间的 RFC 3339 日期"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/totalCalls/description
msgid "Number of times the webhook has been called."
msgstr "Webhook 被调用的次数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/responses/404/description
msgid "The specified webhook was not found."
msgstr "未找到指定的 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/get/description
msgid ""
"This API returns details about a webhook including its URL and metadata "
"about its use."
msgstr "此 API 返回 Webhook 的详细信息，包括其 URL 及使用情况的元数据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/summary
msgid "Update a webhook"
msgstr "修改 Webhook"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/responses/204/description
msgid "The webhook was successfully updated."
msgstr "Webhook 修改成功。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/responses/404/description
msgid "The webhook could not be updated."
msgstr "无法修改该 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/description
msgid "Update a webhook. Only the fields in the request body will be updated."
msgstr "修改 Webhook。只有请求体中包含的字段会被修改。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid ""
"The request body contains the fields to be updated. Unspecified fields will "
"remain unchanged."
msgstr "请求体包含要修改的字段。未指定的字段将保持不变。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete a webhook"
msgstr "删除 Webhook"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid "The webhook was deleted."
msgstr "Webhook 已删除。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/delete/responses/404/description
msgid "The specified webhook could not be found."
msgstr "找不到指定的 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1webhooks~1{id}/delete/description
msgid ""
"Delete a webhook. If an asychronous task using it is still in progress, the "
"webhook may not be called when the task completes."
msgstr ""
"删除 Webhook。如果使用该 Webhook 的异步任务仍在进行中，任务完成时可能不会调用"
"该 Webhook。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/summary
msgid "Create a secret"
msgstr "创建保密信息"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The secret was successfully created. A Location header containing the URL of "
"the new secret is returned. Example: <code>Location: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/secrets/60d6707cca3e387d2a28fc9e</code>. \n"
msgstr ""
"保密信息创建成功。返回的 Location 头中包含新保密信息的 URL。示例："
"<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/secrets/"
"60d6707cca3e387d2a28fc9e</code>。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL of the new secret. The URL follows this format: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/secrets/{secretId} where {secretId} represents the ID of "
"the newly created secret. If you would like to get the secret ID, simply "
"extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest. The ID can be used "
"to query, update, or delete the secret."
msgstr ""
"新保密信息的 URL。URL 格式为：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/secrets/"
"{secretId}，其中 {secretId} 表示新创建的保密信息的 ID。如需获取保密信息 ID，"
"只需提取路径的最后一段，忽略其余部分。该 ID 可用于查询、修改或删除该保密信"
"息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/responses/409/description
msgid "A secret with this name already exists."
msgstr "同名的保密信息已存在。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a secret to protect sensitive text from being exposed in a property's "
"Edge Logic or origins. Refer to the secret in your property's Edge Logic "
"using the <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> syntax. You can also set "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> to "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code>. When you deploy the property, references "
"to <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> will be replaced by the text."
msgstr ""
"创建保密信息，防止敏感文本在加速项目的 Edge Logic 或源站配置中暴露。在加速项"
"目的 Edge Logic 中，使用 <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 语法引用保密信息。"
"您也可以将 <code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 设置为 "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code>。部署加速项目时，对 "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 的引用将被替换为相应的文本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid ""
"The name of the secret. It can consist of letters, numbers, hyphens, "
"underscores, and periods. Refer to this in your Edge Logic using the "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> syntax, or use it as the value of "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code>."
msgstr ""
"保密信息的名称，可以包含字母、数字、连字符、下划线和句点。您可以在边缘逻辑中"
"使用 <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 语法引用它，或将其用作 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 的值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
msgid ""
"A description of the secret. This may be useful for recording the purpose of "
"the secret."
msgstr "保密信息的描述，可用于记录该保密信息的用途。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secret/description
msgid ""
"The sensitive text you want to protect. When you deploy your property, "
"references to <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> in your Edge Logic or in "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> will be replaced by this "
"text. The secret can consist of printable ASCII characters along with the "
"tab, newline, and return characters."
msgstr ""
"您要保护的敏感文本。部署加速项目时，边缘逻辑中或 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 中对 "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 的引用将被替换为此文本。保密信息可以包含可打"
"印 ASCII 字符以及制表符、换行符和回车符。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/post/requestBody/description
msgid ""
"The request body contains the name of the secret along with the sensitive "
"text to protect."
msgstr "请求体包含保密信息的名称以及要保护的敏感文本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of secrets"
msgstr "获取保密信息列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a list of secrets."
msgstr "响应体包含保密信息列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid ""
"Total number of secrets. The actual number returned in the <i>secrets</i> "
"field of the response will depend on the limit and offset parameters."
msgstr ""
"保密信息总数。响应的 <i>secrets</i> 字段中实际返回的数量取决于 limit 和 "
"offset 参数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/description
msgid "A list of secrets."
msgstr "保密信息列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/description
msgid "List of secrets."
msgstr "保密信息列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/id/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/parameters/0/description
msgid "ID of a secret."
msgstr "保密信息的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/name/description
msgid ""
"Name of the secret. It can consist of letters, numbers, hyphens, "
"underscores, and periods. Refer to this in your Edge Logic as "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code>, or use it as the value of "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code>."
msgstr ""
"保密信息的名称，可以包含字母、数字、连字符、下划线和句点。您可以在边缘逻辑中"
"以 <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 的形式引用它，或将其用作 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 的值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/description/description
msgid "A description of the secret."
msgstr "保密信息的描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/creationTime/description
msgid ""
"An RFC 3339 date indicating when the secret was created. This will be in UTC "
"time, for example, \"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\".\n"
msgstr ""
"表示保密信息创建时间的 RFC 3339 日期，采用 UTC 时间，例如 "
"\"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid ""
"An RFC 3339 date indicating when the secret was last updated, for example, "
"\"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\".\n"
msgstr ""
"表示保密信息最后修改时间的 RFC 3339 日期，例如 \"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secrets/items/properties/ownerCustomerId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ownerCustomerId/description
msgid "ID of the customer that owns the secret."
msgstr "拥有该保密信息的客户的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/responses/403/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/403/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/responses/403/description
msgid "Access denied. Check the credentials you used."
msgstr "访问被拒绝。请检查您使用的凭据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of secrets that have been defined. Filter the results using the "
"query parameters."
msgstr "获取已定义的保密信息列表。您可以使用查询参数筛选结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/parameters/0/description
msgid "Index of the first secret to return."
msgstr "要返回的第一个保密信息的索引。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/parameters/1/description
msgid "Maximum number of secrets to return."
msgstr "要返回的保密信息的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include secrets from the caller.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Only secrets owned by children customers "
"will be included.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include secrets of "
"both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</th><th>"
"行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>包含调用者自己的保密信息。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户拥有的保密信息。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的保密信息。</td></"
"tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"The value of the search parameter is matched on the id, name, and "
"description fields of the secrets. Partial matches are supported."
msgstr ""
"search 参数的值将与保密信息的 id、name 和 description 字段进行匹配，支持部分"
"匹配。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1purges~1purgeTokens/get/summary
msgid "Get available purge requests"
msgstr "获取可用的刷新请求数"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1purges~1purgeTokens/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response indicates the number of available purge requests."
msgstr "响应表示可用的刷新请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1purges~1purgeTokens/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filePurgeTokens/description
msgid "Number of file URL purge requests available."
msgstr "可用的文件 URL 刷新请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1purges~1purgeTokens/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/dirPurgeTokens/description
msgid " Number of directory URL purge requests available."
msgstr "可用的目录 URL 刷新请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1purges~1purgeTokens/get/description
msgid ""
"This API indicates the number of directory and file purge requests you can "
"make in the staging or production environments. Your <a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-"
"product-management/get-cdn-servicequotas-customer-customerid\">service "
"quota</a> specifies a daily limit on file and directory purges for "
"production and staging environments. You can temporarily exceed the limit "
"during a day, but it will reduce the number of purges available during the "
"next day."
msgstr ""
"本 API 用于查询您在演练环境或生产环境中可发起的目录刷新请求和文件刷新请求的数"
"量。您的<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-servicequotas-"
"customer-customerid\">服务配额</a>规定了生产环境和演练环境中文件刷新和目录刷"
"新的每日上限。您可以在某一天内临时超出该上限，但这会减少次日可用的刷新次数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/summary
msgid "Get a secret"
msgstr "获取保密信息"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains details about the secret."
msgstr "响应体包含该保密信息的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/id/description
msgid "ID of the secret."
msgstr "保密信息的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid ""
"Name of the secret. It can consist of letters, numbers, hyphens, "
"underscores, and periods. Refer to this in your Edge Logic using the "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> syntax, or use it as the value of "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code>."
msgstr ""
"保密信息的名称，可以包含字母、数字、连字符、下划线和句点。您可以在边缘逻辑中"
"使用 <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 语法引用它，或将其用作 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 的值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
msgid "Description of the secret."
msgstr "保密信息的描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secret/description
msgid ""
"The value of the secret. The secret can consist of printable ASCII "
"characters along with the tab, newline, and return characters. For security, "
"we will not show all the characters. The middle of the secret will be masked "
"out by asterisk characters. References to <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> "
"in your Edge Logic or in <code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> "
"will be replaced by the value."
msgstr ""
"保密信息的值。保密信息可以包含可打印 ASCII 字符以及制表符、换行符和回车符。出"
"于安全考虑，我们不会显示全部字符，保密信息的中间部分将以星号遮盖。边缘逻辑中"
"或 <code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 中对 "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 的引用将被替换为该值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid ""
"An RFC 3339 date indicating when the secret was last updated, for example, "
"\"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"."
msgstr ""
"表示保密信息最后修改时间的 RFC 3339 日期，例如 \"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
msgid ""
"An RFC 3339 date indicating when the secret was created. This will be in UTC "
"time, for example, \"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"."
msgstr ""
"表示保密信息创建时间的 RFC 3339 日期，采用 UTC 时间，例如 "
"\"2021-07-06T00:00:00Z\"。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageInProduction/description
msgid ""
"Properties deployed to production that refer to the secret in Edge Logic or "
"origins."
msgstr "已部署到生产环境、并在边缘逻辑或源站中引用该保密信息的加速项目。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageInProduction/items/properties/propertyId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageInStaging/items/properties/propertyId/description
msgid "ID of a property using the secret."
msgstr "使用该保密信息的加速项目的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageInStaging/description
msgid ""
"Properties deployed to staging that refer to the secret in Edge Logic or "
"origins."
msgstr "已部署到演练环境、并在边缘逻辑或源站中引用该保密信息的加速项目。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/responses/404/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/responses/404/description
msgid "The secret could not be found."
msgstr "找不到该保密信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/get/description
msgid ""
"Get details about a secret including its usage in properties deployed to "
"staging and production. Usage includes references in Edge Logic as well as "
"in <code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code>."
msgstr ""
"获取保密信息的详情，包括其在已部署到演练环境和生产环境的加速项目中的使用情"
"况。使用情况包括在边缘逻辑中的引用以及在 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 中的引用。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/summary
msgid "Update a secret"
msgstr "修改保密信息"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/responses/204/description
msgid "The secret was successfully updated."
msgstr "保密信息修改成功。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/responses/404/description
msgid "The secret was not found."
msgstr "未找到该保密信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/responses/409/description
msgid ""
"The secret could not be updated because the name is already used by another "
"secret."
msgstr "无法修改该保密信息，因为该名称已被其他保密信息使用。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/description
msgid ""
"Update a secret using this API. Deployed properties using the secret will "
"continue to use its original value at the time of deployment. If you change "
"the secret's name, property versions referring to the old name will not pass "
"future validations until you edit the properties to remove the references or "
"update them to use a valid secret's name. If you change the secret's value, "
"properties using the secret must be revalidated before they can be "
"redeployed. "
msgstr ""
"使用本 API 修改保密信息。已部署的使用该保密信息的加速项目将继续使用部署时的原"
"始值。如果您修改了保密信息的名称，引用旧名称的加速项目版本将无法通过后续验"
"证，直到您编辑这些加速项目，删除相关引用或将其改为引用有效的保密信息名称。如"
"果您修改了保密信息的值，使用该保密信息的加速项目必须重新验证后才能重新部署。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid ""
"Name of the secret. It can consist of letters, numbers, hyphens, "
"underscores, and periods. Refer to this in your Edge Logic using the "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> syntax, or use it as the value of "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code>. If you change the name, "
"property versions referring to the old name will not pass future validation."
msgstr ""
"保密信息的名称，可以包含字母、数字、连字符、下划线和句点。您可以在边缘逻辑中"
"使用 <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 语法引用它，或将其用作 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 的值。如果您修改了名称，"
"引用旧名称的加速项目版本将无法通过之后的验证。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/secret/description
msgid ""
"The sensitive text you want to protect. The secret can consist of printable "
"ASCII characters along with the tab, newline, and return characters. When "
"you deploy your property, references to <code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> in "
"your Edge Logic or in <code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> "
"will be replaced by this text. Once the property is deployed, it will use "
"the value of the secret at that time. If you change the secret's value and "
"want your property to use the new value, you must revalidate and redeploy "
"the property."
msgstr ""
"您要保护的敏感文本。保密信息可以包含可打印 ASCII 字符以及制表符、换行符和回车"
"符。部署加速项目时，边缘逻辑中或 "
"<code>origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey</code> 中对 "
"<code>$SECRET(secretName)</code> 的引用将被替换为此文本。加速项目部署后，将使"
"用部署时保密信息的值。如果您修改了保密信息的值并希望加速项目使用新值，则必须"
"重新验证并重新部署该加速项目。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid "Specify the fields you want to update."
msgstr "指定您要修改的字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete a secret"
msgstr "删除保密信息"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid "The secret has been deleted."
msgstr "保密信息已删除。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/responses/403/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/delete/responses/403/description
msgid "Access denied"
msgstr "访问被拒绝"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/responses/409/description
msgid ""
"The secret is in use in production or staging and cannot be deleted. You can "
"call the <a href=\"/apidocs/secret-management/get-cdn-secrets-secretid\">Get "
"a secret API</a> to identify the deployed properties using the secret."
msgstr ""
"该保密信息正在生产环境或演练环境中使用，无法删除。您可以调用<a href=\"/"
"apidocs/secret-management/get-cdn-secrets-secretid\">获取保密信息 API</a>，查"
"看使用该保密信息的已部署加速项目。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1secrets~1{secretID}/delete/description
msgid ""
"Delete a secret by its ID. A secret used in a deployed property cannot be "
"deleted. If a secret is obsolete, you must remove its references in "
"properties, revalidate, and redeploy before you can delete the secret."
msgstr ""
"按 ID 删除保密信息。已部署的加速项目所使用的保密信息无法删除。如果某个保密信"
"息已不再使用，您必须先删除加速项目中对它的引用，重新验证并重新部署，然后才能"
"删除该保密信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of log configurations"
msgstr "获取日志配置列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a summary of the log configurations."
msgstr "响应体包含日志配置的汇总信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/description
msgid "List of log configurations."
msgstr "日志配置列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/logConfigId/description
msgid ""
"An ID representating the log configuration. Use the ID to get, update, or "
"delete the configuration later."
msgstr "表示日志配置的 ID。之后可使用该 ID 获取、修改或删除该配置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/hostnames/description
msgid ""
"A list of hostnames to which the log configuration applies. A hostname "
"should be a fully qualified domain name like <i>domain.com</i>, a wildcard "
"domain name with a leading '\\*' like <i>\\*.domain.com</i>, or '\\*' if you "
"want the log configuration to apply to all hostnames."
msgstr ""
"日志配置所适用的加速域名列表。加速域名应为完全限定域名（如 <i>domain.com</"
"i>）、以 '\\*' 开头的泛域名（如 <i>\\*.domain.com</i>），或者为 '\\*'（如果您"
"希望日志配置适用于所有加速域名）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/description/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "A description of the log configuration."
msgstr "日志配置的描述。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the log configuration was last updated."
msgstr "表示日志配置最后修改时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/creationTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the log configuration was created."
msgstr "表示日志配置创建时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logConfigs/items/properties/customerId/description
msgid ""
"ID of a child customer if a reseller calls the API with Report-Range header "
"value of <i>self+children</i> or <i>children-only</i>."
msgstr ""
"代理商调用 API 时，如果 Report-Range 头的值为 <i>self+children</i> 或 "
"<i>children-only</i>，此字段为子客户的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid "Number of log configurations."
msgstr "日志配置的数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/description
msgid "Obtain a list of log configurations you have created."
msgstr "获取您已创建的日志配置列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/parameters/1/description
msgid "Search for hostnames affected by the log configuration."
msgstr "搜索受该日志配置影响的加速域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/parameters/2/description
msgid "Index of the first log configuration to return."
msgstr "要返回的第一个日志配置的索引。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/parameters/3/description
msgid "Maximum number of log configurations to return."
msgstr "要返回的日志配置的最大数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include log configurations from the caller.</"
"td></tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Only log configurations owned by "
"children customers will be included.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</"
"td><td>Include log configurations of both the caller and children customers."
"</td></tr></table>"
msgstr ""
"可选请求头，代理商可用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</th><th>"
"行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>包含调用者自己的日志配置。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户拥有的日志配置。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的日志配置。</td></"
"tr></table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/post/summary
msgid "Create a log configuration"
msgstr "创建日志配置"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The log configuration was successfully created. The Location header contains "
"a URL to the new log configuration. Example:<code>Location: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/report/logConfigs/4427</code>."
msgstr ""
"日志配置已成功创建。Location 头中包含新日志配置的 URL。示例：<code>Location: "
"https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/report/logConfigs/4427</code>。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL to the new log configuration. The URL follows this format: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn/report/logConfigs/{logConfigurationId} where "
"{logConfigurationId} represents the ID of the log configuration. If you "
"would like to get the log configuration ID, simply extract the last portion "
"of the path and ignore the rest. You can use the ID to create, update, or "
"delete the log configuration."
msgstr ""
"新日志配置的 URL。URL 格式如下：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/report/"
"logConfigs/{logConfigurationId}，其中 {logConfigurationId} 表示日志配置的 "
"ID。如需获取日志配置 ID，只需提取路径的最后一部分，忽略其余部分即可。您可以使"
"用该 ID 创建、修改或删除日志配置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a log configuration used to format the <a href=\"/apidocs/reports/"
"post-cdn-report-logdownload\">access logs</a> for one or more hostnames. An "
"applicable log configuration must exist for you to obtain logs for a "
"hostname. It can take up to 40 minutes for the log configuration to take "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"创建日志配置，用于设置一个或多个加速域名的<a href=\"/apidocs/reports/post-"
"cdn-report-logdownload\">访问日志</a>格式。必须存在适用的日志配置，您才能获取"
"某个加速域名的日志。日志配置最多可能需要 40 分钟才能生效。"

