#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/hostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logConfigs~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hostnames/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"A list of hostnames to which the log configuration applies. A hostname "
"should be a fully qualified domain name like <i>domain.com</i>, a wildcard "
"domain name with a leading '\\*' like <i>\\*.domain.com</i>, or '\\*' if you "
"want the log configuration to apply to all hostnames. You should ensure that "
"only one log configuration applies to each hostname."
msgstr ""
"日志配置所适用的加速域名列表。加速域名应为完全限定域名（如 <i>domain.com</"
"i>）、以 '\\*' 开头的泛域名（如 <i>\\*.domain.com</i>），或者为 '\\*'（如果您"
"希望该日志配置适用于所有加速域名）。您应确保每个加速域名只适用一个日志配置。"

