#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logDownload/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logs/items/properties/logUrl/description
msgid ""
"URL to the log file. The file has been compressed using gzip. Refer to the "
"API description for details about the format. The URL is valid for 10 hours. "
"If you need to download the logs again after that, you must make another "
"request to this API to get a new URL."
msgstr ""
"日志文件的 URL。该文件已使用 gzip 压缩。有关格式的详细信息，请参阅 API 描述。"
"该 URL 的有效期为 10 小时。如果之后需要再次下载日志，您必须再次调用此 API 以"
"获取新的 URL。"

