"该 URL 的有效期为 24 小时。如果之后需要再次下载日志，您必须重新调用本 API 以"
"获取新的 URL。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1logDownload/get/parameters/2/description
msgid "Hostname whose logs you want. "
msgstr "您需要获取其日志的加速域名。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of traffic bandwidth"
msgstr "获取带宽汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of traffic bandwidth by group. It can "
"contain up to 10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value "
"of \"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" "
"contains the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. "
"When \"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含按分组统计的带宽汇总。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 10000 "
"个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所有分组"
"的总计，包括超出 10000 个限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总计等于"
"其他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "bandwidthSummaryResponse"
msgstr "bandwidthSummaryResponse"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid "This describes the response to the bandwidth summary report APIs."
msgstr "描述带宽汇总报表 API 的响应。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/endTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/endTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/endTime/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating the end."
msgstr "表示结束时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of data returned. \"edge bandwidth\" represents edge "
"bandwidth traffic. "
msgstr "表示返回数据的类型。\"edge bandwidth\" 表示边缘带宽。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"This object contains the breakdown of traffic by group. Groups are "
"determined by the request body."
msgstr "此对象包含按分组细分的流量。分组由请求体决定。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of traffic bandwidth during a time period. You can filter and "
"group results by hostnames or server groups. If you are a reseller, you can "
"also filter and group by customerIds to distinguish your child customers' "
"traffic."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内的带宽汇总。您可以按加速域名或节点组对结果进行过滤和分组。如果"
"您是代理商，还可以按 customerIds 进行过滤和分组，以区分各子客户的流量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/parameters/3/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"Limit the results to the specified scheme. By default, all traffic is "
"returned."
msgstr "将结果限定为指定的协议（scheme）。默认返回全部流量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'serverGroups', 'customerIds', 'propertyHostnames', and "
"'legacyTypes'. Only resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用以下选项中最多两项的组合对结果进行分"
"组：'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds'、'propertyHostnames' 和 "
"'legacyTypes'。只有代理商可以指定 'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of traffic bandwidth during a time period. Query parameters "
"let you specify the time period, scheme, and whether to group the results. "
"If you are a reseller, you can also group by customerIds to distinguish your "
"child customers' traffic."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内的带宽汇总。您可以通过查询参数指定时间段、协议以及是否对结果进"
"行分组。如果您是代理商，还可以按 customerIds 分组，以区分各子客户的流量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'serverGroups', 'customerIds', ' propertyHostnames',  and 'legacyTypes' by "
"specifying a comma-separated list of the keywords. Only resellers can "
"specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过指定以逗号分隔的关键字列表，使用 "
"'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds'、' propertyHostnames' 和 "
"'legacyTypes' 中最多两项的任意组合对结果进行分组。只有代理商可以指定 "
"'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of status codes returned by edge servers"
msgstr "获取边缘服务器返回的状态码汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of status codes returned by the CDN Pro edge "
"servers. It can contain up to 10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 "
"groups, the value of \"isComplete\" will be false. A special group "
"\"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains the total for all groups including those beyond "
"the 10000 limit. When \"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all "
"other returned groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含CDN Pro 边缘服务器返回的状态码汇总。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组"
"超过 10000 个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包"
"含所有分组的总计，包括超出 10000 个限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，"
"该总计等于其他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. (+1 more)
msgid "originStatusCodeSummaryResponse"
msgstr "originStatusCodeSummaryResponse"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of status codes returned by your origin "
"servers. It can contain up to 10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 "
"groups, the value of \"isComplete\" will be false. A special group "
"\"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains the total for all groups including those beyond "
"the 10000 limit. When \"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all "
"other returned groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含您的源站返回的状态码汇总。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 "
"10000 个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所"
"有分组的总计，包括超出 10000 个限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总"
"计等于其他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"A list of HTTP status codes represented as strings. The order of the entries "
"in the <i>dataNames</i> array corresponds to the order of values returned in "
"the <i>data</i> array in the response."
msgstr ""
"以字符串表示的 HTTP 状态码列表。<i>dataNames</i> 数组中条目的顺序与响应中 "
"<i>data</i> 数组返回值的顺序相对应。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/description
msgid ""
"Gets a summary of HTTP status codes returned by requests to the CDN Pro edge "
"servers during a time period. Query parameters let you specify the time "
"period and scheme. Filter the results further by passing a <i>filters</i> "
"object in the request. This report's data has a latency of up to thirty "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 CDN Pro 边缘服务器对请求返回的 HTTP 状态码汇总。您可以通过查询"
"参数指定时间段和协议，并可在请求中传入 <i>filters</i> 对象进一步过滤结果。该"
"报表的数据延迟最长为 30 分钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/parameters/0/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/parameters/0/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the beginning of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>startdate=2021-09-05T00:00:00Z</code> "
msgstr ""
"表示时间段开始的 RFC 3339 日期。时间必须使用 UTC 时区指定，不能使用时区偏移。"
"示例：<code>startdate=2021-09-05T00:00:00Z</code> "

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/get/parameters/2/description
#. (+4 more)
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2021-09-05T10:00:00Z</code> Due to latency associated with new "
"traffic data, enddate should be no later than five minutes before the "
"current time. This ensures you get the most accurate results."
msgstr ""
"表示时间段结束的 RFC 3339 日期。时间必须使用 UTC 时区指定，不能使用时区偏移。"
"示例：<code>enddate=2021-09-05T10:00:00Z</code> 由于新流量数据存在延迟，"
"enddate 应不晚于当前时间前五分钟，以确保您获得最准确的结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
msgid ""
"Resellers can specify the IDs of child customers for which to return data."
msgstr "代理商可以指定要返回数据的子客户 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'serverGroups', and 'customerIds'. Only resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 'hostnames'、'serverGroups' 和 'customerIds' 中最多两项的任意组合"
"对结果进行分组。只有代理商可以指定 'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body can include options to customize the results."
msgstr "请求体可以包含用于自定义结果的选项。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/description
msgid ""
"Gets a summary of HTTP status codes returned by requests to the CDN Pro edge "
"servers during a time period. Query parameters let you specify the time "
"period, scheme, and whether to group the results. This report's data has a "
"latency of up to thirty minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 CDN Pro 边缘服务器对请求返回的 HTTP 状态码汇总。您可以通过查询"
"参数指定时间段、协议以及是否对结果进行分组。该报表的数据延迟最长为 30 分钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/parameters/2/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2021-09-05T10:00:00Z</code>  Due to latency associated with "
"new traffic data, enddate should be no later than five minutes before the "
"current time. This ensures you get the most accurate results."
msgstr ""
"表示时间段结束的 RFC 3339 日期。时间必须使用 UTC 时区指定，不能使用时区偏移。"
"示例：<code>enddate=2021-09-05T10:00:00Z</code>  由于新流量数据存在延迟，"
"enddate 应不晚于当前时间前五分钟，以确保您获得最准确的结果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/get/parameters/4/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/get/parameters/4/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'serverGroups', 'customerIds', and 'propertyHostnames' by specifying a comma-"
"separated list of the keywords. Only resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过指定以逗号分隔的关键字列表，使用 "
"'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds' 和 'propertyHostnames' 中最多两项"
"的任意组合对结果进行分组。只有代理商可以指定 'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/summary
msgid "Get IP addresses of the CDN"
msgstr "获取 CDN 的 IP 地址"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains the IP addresses."
msgstr "响应体包含 IP 地址。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdated/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdated/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating when the list of IP addresses was last updated."
msgstr "表示 IP 地址列表最近更新时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/effectiveDate/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the IP address list became effective."
msgstr "表示 IP 地址列表生效时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV4/description
msgid "IPv4 addresses used by CDN Pro."
msgstr "CDN Pro 使用的 IPv4 地址。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV6/description
msgid "IPv6 addresses used by CDN Pro."
msgstr "CDN Pro 使用的 IPv6 地址。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1publicIpList/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of IP addresses used by CDN Pro. If your property's origin "
"configuration uses the directConnection setting 'noDirect', and its Edge "
"Logic does not use the [origin fast route directive](</docs/edge-logic/"
"supported-directives#origin_fast_route>), you can restrict access to your "
"origin servers by updating your allow lists with these IP addresses. Since "
"the CDN's IP addresses can periodically change, we recommend that you check "
"once a day and update your allow lists."
msgstr ""
"获取 CDN Pro 使用的 IP 地址列表。如果您加速项目的源站配置将 directConnection "
"设置为 'noDirect'，且其边缘逻辑未使用[回源快速通道指令](</docs/edge-logic/"
"supported-directives#origin_fast_route>)，您可以将这些 IP 地址加入允许列表，"
"以限制对源站服务器的访问。由于 CDN 的 IP 地址可能会定期变化，建议您每天检查一"
"次并更新允许列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of status codes returned by origin servers"
msgstr "获取源站返回的状态码汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/description
msgid ""
"Gets a summary of HTTP status codes returned by requests to your origin "
"servers during a time period. Query parameters let you specify the time "
"period and scheme. Filter the results further by passing a <i>filters</i> "
"object in the request. This report's data has a latency of up to thirty "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内您的源站服务器对请求返回的 HTTP 状态码汇总。您可以通过查询参数"
"指定时间段和协议，并可在请求中传入 <i>filters</i> 对象进一步过滤结果。该报表"
"的数据延迟最长为 30 分钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'serverGroups', 'customerIds', and 'propertyHostnames'. Only "
"resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用以下选项中最多两项的组合对结果进行分"
"组：'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds' 和 'propertyHostnames'。只有代"
"理商可以指定 'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/post/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body can include options to filter and group the results."
msgstr "请求体可以包含用于筛选和分组结果的选项。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1originStatusSummary/get/description
msgid ""
"Gets a summary of HTTP status codes returned by requests to your origin "
"servers during a time period. Query parameters let you specify the time "
"period, scheme, and whether to group the results. This report's data has a "
"latency of up to thirty minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内您的源站服务器对请求返回的 HTTP 状态码汇总。您可以通过查询参数"
"指定时间段、协议以及是否对结果进行分组。该报表的数据延迟最长为 30 分钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of CPU usage"
msgstr "获取 CPU 使用汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of CPU usage by group. It can contain up to "
"10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value of "
"\"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains "
"the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. When "
"\"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含按分组统计的 CPU 使用汇总。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 "
"10000 个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所"
"有分组的总计，包括超出 10000 个限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总"
"计等于其他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "cpuSummaryResponse"
msgstr "cpuSummaryResponse"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of CPU usage. It can contain up to 10000 "
"groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value of \"isComplete\" "
"will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains the total for "
"all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. When \"isComplete\" is "
"true, the total is the sum of all other returned groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含CPU 使用汇总。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 10000 个，"
"\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所有分组的总"
"计，包括超出 10000 个限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总计等于其他"
"所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of data returned. \n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>Data Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>edge cpu time</td><td>CPU usage by edge servers</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>intermediate cpu time</td><td>CPU usage by intermediate CDN Pro "
"servers</td></tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"The order of the entries in <i>dataNames</i> array corresponds to the order "
"of values returned in the <i>data</i> data array in the response."
msgstr ""
"表示返回数据的类型。\n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>数据名称</th><th>描述</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>edge cpu time</td><td>边缘服务器的 CPU 使用量</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>intermediate cpu time</td><td>CDN Pro 中间层服务器的 CPU 使用量</"
"td></tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"<i>dataNames</i> 数组中条目的顺序与响应中 <i>data</i> 数组返回值的顺序相对"
"应。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
msgid "This object contains the breakdown of CPU usage by group. "
msgstr "此对象包含按分组细分的 CPU 使用量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/get/description
msgid "Obtain a summary of CPU usage by edge and intermediate servers."
msgstr "获取边缘服务器和中间层服务器的 CPU 使用汇总。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
msgid ""
"An object that can be passed to summary report API calls to filter and group "
"the results. For example, you can specify to return data only for a "
"particular hostname."
msgstr ""
"可传递给汇总报表 API 调用的对象，用于筛选和分组结果。例如，您可以指定仅返回某"
"个特定加速域名的数据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1cpuSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'serverGroups',  'customerIds', and 'propertyHostnames'.  Only "
"resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用以下选项中最多两项的组合对结果进行分"
"组：'hostnames'、'serverGroups'、'customerIds' 和 'propertyHostnames'。只有代"
"理商可以指定 'customerIds'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1prefetchTokens/get/summary
msgid "Get available prefetch requests"
msgstr "获取可用的预取请求数"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1prefetchTokens/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response indicates the number of prefetches available."
msgstr "响应表示可用的预取次数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1prefetchTokens/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchTokens/description
msgid "Number of prefetch requests that can be made."
msgstr "可发起的预取请求数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1prefetchTokens/get/description
msgid ""
"This API indicates the number of prefetch requests you can make. Your <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-management/get-cdn-servicequotas-customer-"
"customerid\">service quota</a> specifies a daily limit on prefetch requests. "
"You can temporarily exceed the limit during a day, but it will reduce the "
"number of prefetches available during the next day."
msgstr ""
"本 API 用于查询您可发起的预取请求数量。您的<a href=\"/apidocs/cdn-product-"
"management/get-cdn-servicequotas-customer-customerid\">服务配额</a>规定了预取"
"请求的每日上限。您可以在某一天内临时超出该上限，但这会减少次日可用的预取次"
"数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of origin shields"
msgstr "获取源站 Shield 列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a list of shield servers. You may configure a "
"property  to use one of the origin shields."
msgstr ""
"响应包含 Shield 服务器列表。您可以将加速项目配置为使用其中一个源站 Shield。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/description
msgid "A list of shields that can be used in a property."
msgstr "可在加速项目中使用的 Shield 列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/description
msgid "Describes a shield"
msgstr "描述一个 Shield"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
msgid "Name of the shield."
msgstr "Shield 的名称。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/id/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/id/description
msgid ""
"A unique identifier representing the shield. This ID is referenced in "
"properties using the shield."
msgstr "代表该 Shield 的唯一标识符。使用该 Shield 的加速项目会引用此 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/region/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/region/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the region of the origin shield. It is typically an ISO-3166-1 "
"code representing a country. When choosing an origin shield for your "
"property, it is best to select one closer to your origin servers.\n"
"Use of a shield located in the \"cn\" region (China) requires your property "
"to have 'hasBeian' set to true which means all of its hostnames have an ICP "
"Beian license required by the Chinese government."
msgstr ""
"表示源站 Shield 所在的区域，通常为代表国家的 ISO-3166-1 代码。为加速项目选择"
"源站 Shield 时，最好选择距离您的源站较近的 Shield。\n"
"要使用位于 \"cn\" 区域（中国）的 Shield，您的加速项目必须将 'hasBeian' 设置"
"为 true，即其所有加速域名都已取得中国政府要求的 ICP 备案。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/ipV4/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV4/description
msgid ""
"A list of IPv4 addresses used by the shield. If your origin server has an "
"access control list, include these IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"该 Shield 使用的 IPv4 地址列表。如果您的源站设有访问控制列表，请将这些 IP 地"
"址加入其中。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/ipV6/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV6/description
msgid ""
"A list of IPv6 addresses used by the shield. If your origin server has an "
"access control list, include these IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"该 Shield 使用的 IPv6 地址列表。如果您的源站设有访问控制列表，请将这些 IP 地"
"址加入其中。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/lastUpdated/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/lastUpdated/description
msgid "An RFC 3339 date indicating when the shield was last updated."
msgstr "表示该 Shield 最近更新时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/effectiveDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/effectiveDate/description
msgid "An RFC 3339 date indicating when the shield became active."
msgstr "表示该 Shield 生效时间的 RFC 3339 日期。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/usedInProperties/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usedInProperties/description
msgid ""
"Whether the shield is used in any properties deployed to staging or "
"production."
msgstr "该 Shield 是否被已部署到演练环境或生产环境的任一加速项目使用。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of shields that can be used as an extra layer between the CDN Pro "
"edge servers and your origin servers. A shield can further reduce the number "
"of requests to your origin and limit the requests to a smaller set of "
"servers. \n"
"This is an advanced feature. If you require this feature, please contact our "
"support team."
msgstr ""
"获取 Shield 列表。Shield 可作为 CDN Pro 边缘服务器与您的源站服务器之间的额外"
"一层，进一步减少发往源站的请求数，并将这些请求限制在更小范围的服务器上。\n"
"这是一项高级功能。如需使用该功能，请联系我们的技术支持团队。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"The value of the search parameter is matched on the shields' name, id, "
"regions, ipV4 , and ipV6 fields. Only those shields that match will be "
"returned in the response."
msgstr ""
"search 参数的值将与 Shield 的 name、id、regions、ipV4 和 ipV6 字段进行匹配。"
"响应中只返回匹配的 Shield。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"Returns shields sorted by their ID, when they were last updated, or when "
"they became active."
msgstr "按 ID、最近更新时间或生效时间对返回的 Shield 进行排序。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/parameters/2/description
msgid ""
"Returns shields in sorted order, either \"asc\" for ascending or \"desc\" "
"for descending. The default is to return shields sorted by ID in ascending "
"order."
msgstr ""
"按排序顺序返回 Shield，\"asc\" 表示升序，\"desc\" 表示降序。默认按 ID 升序返"
"回 Shield。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"Filter results based on whether shields are used in properties deployed to "
"staging or production. If unspecified, all available shields are returned."
msgstr ""
"根据 Shield 是否被已部署到演练环境或生产环境的加速项目使用来筛选结果。如未指"
"定，则返回所有可用的 Shield。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/parameters/0/description
msgid "ID of a shield"
msgstr "Shield 的 ID"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/summary
msgid "Get a shield by its ID"
msgstr "按 ID 获取 Shield"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains details about the shield."
msgstr "响应体包含该 Shield 的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/description
msgid ""
"Obtain information about a shield which can be used as an extra layer "
"between the CDN Pro edge servers and your origin servers. This is an "
"advanced feature. If you require this feature, please contact our support "
"team."
msgstr ""
"获取 Shield 的信息。Shield 可作为 CDN Pro 边缘服务器与您的源站服务器之间的额"
"外一层。这是一项高级功能。如需使用该功能，请联系我们的技术支持团队。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of log aggregation points."
msgstr "获取日志汇聚点列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response contains a list of log aggregation points."
msgstr "响应包含日志汇聚点列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/count/description
msgid "Number of log aggregation points."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的数量。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/description
msgid "Contains log aggregation points."
msgstr "包含日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/items/description
msgid "Identifies a log aggregation point."
msgstr "标识一个日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/items/properties/id/description
msgid "ID of the log aggregation point."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/items/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/name/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid "Name of the log aggregation point."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的名称。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/items/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "When the log aggregation point was created."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的创建时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/logAggregationPoints/items/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid "When the log aggregation point was updated."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的更新时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a list of log aggregation points that are used to collect raw server "
"logs."
msgstr "获取用于收集原始服务器日志的日志汇聚点列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/get/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"The value of the search parameter is matched on the name, description, and "
"destinationURL fields of log aggregation points. Partial matches are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"search 参数的值将与日志汇聚点的 name、description 和 destinationURL 字段进行"
"匹配。支持部分匹配。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/summary
msgid "Create a log aggregation point"
msgstr "创建日志汇聚点"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The log aggregation point was sucessfully created. The Location header "
"contains a URL to the new log aggregation point. Example: <code>Location: "
"https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/logAggregationPoints/"
"123ab3dda4081d2ca71898fd</code>. \n"
"\n"
"The response body includes an ingestURL field containing a URL that can be "
"used in the <i>logUrl</i> field of the <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"management/createproperty\">realTimeLog setting in a property</a>."
msgstr ""
"日志汇聚点已成功创建。Location 头中包含新日志汇聚点的 URL。示例："
"<code>Location: https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/logAggregationPoints/"
"123ab3dda4081d2ca71898fd</code>。\n"
"\n"
"响应体中包含 ingestURL 字段，其中的 URL 可用于<a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"management/createproperty\">加速项目 realTimeLog 设置</a>的 <i>logUrl</i> 字"
"段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ingestURL/description
msgid ""
"Ingest URL of the log aggregation point. To use it, specify this URL in the "
"<i>logUrl</i> field of the realTimeLog setting of a property."
msgstr ""
"日志汇聚点的接收 URL。如需使用，请在加速项目 realTimeLog 设置的 <i>logUrl</"
"i> 字段中指定此 URL。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL to the new log aggregation point. The URL follows this format: https://"
"ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/logAggregationPoints/{logAggregationPointId} where "
"{logAggregationPointId} represents the ID of the newly created log "
"aggregation point. If you would like to get the log aggregation point ID, "
"simply extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest. The ID can "
"be used to query, update, or delete the log aggregation point."
msgstr ""
"新日志汇聚点的 URL。URL 格式如下：https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/"
"logAggregationPoints/{logAggregationPointId}，其中 {logAggregationPointId} 表"
"示新创建的日志汇聚点的 ID。如需获取日志汇聚点 ID，只需提取路径的最后一部分，"
"忽略其余部分即可。该 ID 可用于查询、修改或删除日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/409/description
msgid ""
"This error is returned if you try to create a log aggregation point using "
"the name of an existing one."
msgstr "如果您尝试使用已有日志汇聚点的名称创建日志汇聚点，将返回此错误。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a new log aggregation point where batches of logs are sent together "
"rather than individually. The maximum number of log aggregation points that "
"can be created by a customer are defined in the customer's service quota."
msgstr ""
"创建新的日志汇聚点，日志将在此批量发送，而不是逐条发送。客户可创建的日志汇聚"
"点数量上限由该客户的服务配额规定。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/description/description
msgid "An optional description of the log aggregation point."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的描述（可选）。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxEntries/description
msgid "Maximum number of entries to send in a report."
msgstr "一次报送中发送的最大条目数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxLatency/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxEntries/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxLatency/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"Maximum time in seconds allowed by the log processing system at the "
"destination URL."
msgstr "目标 URL 处的日志处理系统所允许的最长时间，单位为秒。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxSizeKBytes/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxSizeKBytes/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/maxSizeKBytes/description
msgid ""
"Maximum aggregate size in kilobytes of logs before gzip compression is "
"applied."
msgstr "应用 gzip 压缩前日志的最大聚合大小，单位为 KB。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/separator/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/separator/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/separator/description
msgid "Text that appears between log entries."
msgstr "日志条目之间的分隔文本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationURL/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationURL/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationURL/description
msgid "URL where logs should be sent."
msgstr "日志发送的目标 URL。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificate/description
msgid ""
"A certificate in PEM format required to connect to the destination URL. If "
"destinationAuthCertificate is specified, the destinationAuthCertificateId "
"field should be empty."
msgstr ""
"连接目标 URL 所需的 PEM 格式证书。如果指定了 destinationAuthCertificate，则 "
"destinationAuthCertificateId 字段应为空。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthKey/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthKey/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthKey/description
msgid ""
"Authentication key in PEM format used to connect to the destination URL."
msgstr "连接目标 URL 所用的 PEM 格式认证密钥。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/gzipToDestination/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/gzipToDestination/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/gzipToDestination/description
msgid "Whether to use gzip compression on data sent to the destination URL."
msgstr "是否对发送到目标 URL 的数据使用 gzip 压缩。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/description
msgid "HTTP headers passed to the destination URL."
msgstr "传递给目标 URL 的 HTTP 头。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/description
msgid "Describes an HTTP header passed to the destination URL."
msgstr "描述一个传递给目标 URL 的 HTTP 头。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/properties/value/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/properties/value/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/headerToDestination/items/properties/value/description
msgid "Value of the HTTP header."
msgstr "HTTP 头的值。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificateId/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificateId/description
msgid ""
"Refers to the ID of a <a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-management/"
"createcertificate\">certificate created in CDN Pro</a>. The latest version "
"of the certificate will be used. The certificate does not need to be "
"deployed to staging or production for it to be used in a log aggregation "
"point. If destinationAuthCertificateId is specified, the "
"destinationAuthCertificate field should be empty."
msgstr ""
"引用<a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-management/createcertificate\">在 CDN Pro "
"中创建的证书</a>的 ID。系统将使用该证书的最新版本。证书无需部署到演练环境或生"
"产环境即可在日志汇聚点中使用。如果指定了 destinationAuthCertificateId，则 "
"destinationAuthCertificate 字段应为空。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefix/description
msgid ""
"Text to prepend before log entries. It can include the variable ${timestamp} "
"which will be replaced by the current Unix timestamp in seconds."
msgstr ""
"添加在日志条目之前的文本。可以包含变量 ${timestamp}，该变量将被替换为以秒为单"
"位的当前 Unix 时间戳。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/postfix/description
msgid ""
"Text to append after log entries. It can include the variable ${timestamp} "
"which will be replaced by the current Unix timestamp in seconds."
msgstr ""
"添加在日志条目之后的文本。可以包含变量 ${timestamp}，该变量将被替换为以秒为单"
"位的当前 Unix 时间戳。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body defines the parameters of the aggregation point."
msgstr "请求体定义了汇聚点的参数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/parameters/0/description
msgid "ID of a log aggregation point"
msgstr "日志汇聚点的 ID"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/summary
msgid "Get details about a log aggregation point"
msgstr "获取日志汇聚点详情"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains details about a log aggregation point."
msgstr "响应体包含日志汇聚点的详细信息。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefix/description
msgid ""
"Text that appears before each log entry. It can include variables.\n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>Variable</th><th>Description</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>${timestamp}</td><td>current Unix timestamp in seconds</td></tr>\n"
"</table>"
msgstr ""
"出现在每条日志条目之前的文本。可以包含变量。\n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>变量</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>${timestamp}</td><td>以秒为单位的当前 Unix 时间戳</td></tr>\n"
"</table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/postfix/description
msgid ""
"Text that appears after each log entry. It can include variables.\n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>Variable</th><th>Description</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>${timestamp}</td><td>current Unix timestamp in seconds</td></tr>\n"
"</table>"
msgstr ""
"出现在每条日志条目之后的文本。可以包含变量。\n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>变量</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>${timestamp}</td><td>以秒为单位的当前 Unix 时间戳</td></tr>\n"
"</table>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificate/description
msgid "A certificate in PEM format required to connect to the destination URL."
msgstr "连接目标 URL 所需的 PEM 格式证书。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/creationTime/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the log aggregation point was created."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示日志汇聚点的创建时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/lastUpdateTime/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating when the log aggregation point was last updated."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示日志汇聚点的最后更新时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/ingestURL/description
msgid ""
"URL used to collect raw log entries from the edge servers before sending "
"them in a batch to the destination URL. Use this URL by entering it into the "
"logURL field of the <a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/"
"createproperty\">realTimeLog settings of a property."
msgstr ""
"用于从边缘服务器收集原始日志条目、再将其批量发送到目标 URL 的 URL。使用方法是"
"将此 URL 填入<a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">加速项"
"目 realTimeLog 设置中的 logURL 字段。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificateId/description
msgid ""
"Refers to the ID of a <a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-management/"
"createcertificate\">certificate created in CDN Pro</a> if this was specified "
"while creating the certificate."
msgstr ""
"如果在创建时指定了<a href=\"/apidocs/certificate-management/"
"createcertificate\">在 CDN Pro 中创建的证书</a>，则此字段引用该证书的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/destinationAuthCertificateVersion/description
msgid "Version of the certificate used."
msgstr "所用证书的版本。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/responses/404/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/responses/404/description
msgid "The log aggregation point does not exist."
msgstr "该日志汇聚点不存在。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/get/description
msgid "Use this API to get details about a log aggregation point."
msgstr "使用本 API 获取日志汇聚点的详情。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/delete/summary
msgid "Delete a log aggregation point"
msgstr "删除日志汇聚点"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/delete/responses/204/description
msgid "The log aggregation point was successfully deleted."
msgstr "已成功删除该日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/delete/responses/404/description
msgid "The log aggregation point was not found."
msgstr "未找到该日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/delete/description
msgid "Use this API to delete a log aggregation point."
msgstr "使用本 API 删除日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/summary
msgid "Update a log aggregation point"
msgstr "修改日志汇聚点"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/responses/204/description
msgid "The log aggregation point was updated."
msgstr "已更新该日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/description
msgid "Use this API to update a log aggregation point."
msgstr "使用本 API 修改日志汇聚点。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1{id}/patch/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body contains the fields to update."
msgstr "请求体包含要更新的字段。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/summary
msgid "Check if IP addresses belong to the CDN Pro platform"
msgstr "检查 IP 地址是否属于 CDN Pro 平台"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response indicates the status of each IP address in the request body."
msgstr "响应列出请求体中每个 IP 地址的状态。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipDetails/description
msgid "Describes an IP address."
msgstr "描述一个 IP 地址。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipDetails/items/properties/ip/description
msgid "An IPv4 or IPv6 address."
msgstr "IPv4 或 IPv6 地址。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipDetails/items/properties/isCdnProIp/description
msgid "True if the IP address belongs to the CDN Pro platform."
msgstr "如果该 IP 地址属于 CDN Pro 平台，则为 true。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipDetails/items/properties/protocol/description
msgid "Indicates the protocol of the IP address."
msgstr "表示该 IP 地址的协议。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/description
msgid ""
"This API allows you to check whether one or more IP addresses belong to the "
"CDN Pro platform."
msgstr "您可以通过本 API 检查一个或多个 IP 地址是否属于 CDN Pro 平台。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipList/description
msgid "Array of IPv4 or IPv6 addresses to check."
msgstr "要检查的 IPv4 或 IPv6 地址数组。"

#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1ipDetails/post/requestBody/description
msgid "The request body consists of an array of IP addresses to check."
msgstr "请求体为要检查的 IP 地址数组。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7/post/summary
msgid "Get the L7 traffic volume"
msgstr "获取 7 层流量"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7/post/description
msgid ""
"Get the OSI layer 7 traffic volume in megabytes during a time period. Query "
"parameters let you specify the time period and granularity of data. Filter "
"the results further by passing a filters object in the request. This "
"report's data has a latency of less than two minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 OSI 7 层流量（单位：MB）。您可以通过查询参数指定时间段和数据粒"
"度，并可在请求中传入 filters 对象进一步过滤结果。该报表的数据延迟小于 2 分"
"钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid ""
"Filter results by specifying hostnames, propertyHostnames, clientRegions, or "
"clientIsps."
msgstr ""
"通过指定 hostnames、propertyHostnames、clientRegions 或 clientIsps 来筛选结"
"果。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/propertyHostnames/description
msgid ""
"A list of property hostnames for which to return data. These correspond to "
"values in the <i>hostnames</i> field of a property configuration. These can "
"differ from the value sent in an HTTP request. For example, if you <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">create a property</a> "
"to accelerate '*.test.com', a client could request content and pass a Host "
"header of 'abc.test.com'. In this case, '\\*.test.com' is a property "
"hostname you can filter by using this field while 'abc.test.com' is a "
"hostname you can filter by using the hostnames field. By default, data for "
"all property hostnames is returned.\n"
msgstr ""
"要返回数据的加速项目域名列表。这些值对应于加速项目配置中 <i>hostnames</i> 字"
"段的值，可能与 HTTP 请求中发送的值不同。例如，如果您<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"property-management/createproperty\">创建加速项目</a>来加速 '*.test.com'，客"
"户端请求内容时可能传递 'abc.test.com' 作为 Host 头。在这种情况"
"下，'\\*.test.com' 是可以通过此字段筛选的加速项目域名，而 'abc.test.com' 是可"
"以通过 hostnames 字段筛选的加速域名。默认返回所有加速项目域名的数据。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/contentCodes/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/contentCodes/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/contentCodes/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"List of content codes for which to return data. Content codes can be defined "
"in your properties' <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> field by setting values for the "
"variable $content_code."
msgstr ""
"要返回数据的内容代码列表。您可以在加速项目的 <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> 字段中"
"为变量 $content_code 赋值来定义内容代码。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7/post/summary
msgid "Get the L7 traffic bandwidth"
msgstr "获取 7 层带宽"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7/post/description
msgid ""
"Get the OSI layer 7 traffic bandwidth in Mbps during a time period. Query "
"parameters let you specify the time period and granularity of data. Filter "
"the results further by passing a filters object in the request. This "
"report's data has a latency of less than two minutes."
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 OSI 7 层带宽（单位：Mbps）。您可以通过查询参数指定时间段和数据"
"粒度，并可在请求中传入 filters 对象进一步过滤结果。该报表的数据延迟小于 2 分"
"钟。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7/post/parameters/4/description
msgid ""
"An optional header that resellers can use to specify whether to include data "
"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include hostnames from the caller.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Only hostnames owned by children customers "
"will be included.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include data from "
"hostnames of both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></"
"table>          \n"
msgstr ""
"可选的请求头，代理商可以用它指定是否包含子客户的数据。<table><tr><th>值</"
"th><th>行为</th></tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>包含调用者的加速域名。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>仅包含子客户拥有的加速域名。</td></"
"tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>同时包含调用者和子客户的加速域名数据。</"
"td></tr></table>          \n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of L7 traffic volume"
msgstr "获取 7 层流量汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of layer 7 traffic volume by group. It can "
"contain up to 10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value "
"of \"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" "
"contains the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. "
"When \"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含按分组汇总的 7 层流量。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 10000 "
"个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所有分组"
"的总计，包括超出 10000 限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总计等于其"
"他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of edge layer 7 traffic volume during a time period. You can "
"filter and group results by hostnames, property hostnames, or content codes. "
"(Content codes can be defined in your properties' <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> "
"field using the $content_code variable.)\n"
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内边缘 7 层流量汇总。您可以按加速域名、加速项目域名或内容代码对结"
"果进行过滤和分组。（内容代码可以在加速项目的 <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> 字段中"
"通过 $content_code 变量定义。）\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
msgid ""
"Choose whether to limit the results to specific hostnames or content codes."
msgstr "选择是否将结果限定为特定的加速域名或内容代码。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/propertyHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/propertyHostnames/description
msgid ""
"A list of property hostnames for which to return data. These correspond to "
"values in the <i>hostnames</i> field of a property configuration. These can "
"differ from the value sent in an HTTP request. For example, if you <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">create a property</a> "
"to accelerate ''*.test.com'', a client could request content and pass a Host "
"header of ''abc.test.com''. In this case, ''\\*.test.com'' is a property "
"hostname you can filter by using this field while ''abc.test.com'' is a "
"hostname you can filter by using the hostnames field. By default, data for "
"all property hostnames is returned."
msgstr ""
"要返回数据的加速项目域名列表。这些值对应于加速项目配置中 <i>hostnames</i> 字"
"段的值，可能与 HTTP 请求中发送的值不同。例如，如果您<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"property-management/createproperty\">创建加速项目</a>来加速 ''*.test.com''，"
"客户端请求内容时可能传递 ''abc.test.com'' 作为 Host 头。在这种情况"
"下，''\\*.test.com'' 是可以通过此字段筛选的加速项目域名，而 ''abc.test.com'' "
"是可以通过 hostnames 字段筛选的加速域名。默认返回所有加速项目域名的数据。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'contentCodes', 'propertyhostnames'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用以下最多两项的组合对结果分"
"组：'hostnames'、'contentCodes'、'propertyhostnames'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/parameters/3/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'propertyHostnames', and 'contentCodes' by specifying a comma-separated list "
"of the keywords."
msgstr ""
"您可以指定以逗号分隔的关键字列表，使用 'hostnames'、'propertyHostnames' 和 "
"'contentCodes' 中最多两项的任意组合对结果分组。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of edge layer 7 traffic volume during a time period. You can "
"group results by hostnames, property hostnames, or content codes. (Content "
"codes can be defined in your properties' <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> field "
"using the $content_code variable.)\n"
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内边缘 7 层流量汇总。您可以按加速域名、加速项目域名或内容代码对结"
"果进行分组。（内容代码可以在加速项目的 <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> 字段中通过 "
"$content_code 变量定义。）\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of layer 7 traffic bandwidth"
msgstr "获取 7 层带宽汇总"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/responses/200/description
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of layer 7 traffic bandwidth by group. It "
"can contain up to 10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the "
"value of \"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" "
"contains the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. "
"When \"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"响应包含按分组汇总的 7 层带宽。最多可包含 10000 个分组。如果分组超过 10000 "
"个，\"isComplete\" 的值将为 false。特殊分组 \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" 包含所有分组"
"的总计，包括超出 10000 限制的分组。当 \"isComplete\" 为 true 时，该总计等于其"
"他所有返回分组之和。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid "Response to the bandwidthL7Summary API"
msgstr "bandwidthL7Summary API 的响应"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
msgid "Indicates the type of data returned."
msgstr "表示返回的数据类型。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/items/properties/group/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/items/properties/group/description
msgid ""
"Name of a group. \"__all__\" is a special group encompassing all groups."
msgstr "分组名称。\"__all__\" 是涵盖所有分组的特殊分组。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of layer 7 traffic bandwidth during a time period. You can "
"filter and group results by hostnames or content codes. (Content codes can "
"be defined in your properties' <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> field using the "
"$content_code variable.)"
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 7 层带宽汇总。您可以按加速域名或内容代码对结果进行过滤和分组。"
"（内容代码可以在加速项目的 <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> 字段中通过 $content_code "
"变量定义。）"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'contentCodes', 'propertyHostnames'."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用以下最多两项的组合对结果分"
"组：'hostnames'、'contentCodes'、'propertyHostnames'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthL7Summary/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of layer 7 traffic bandwidth during a time period. You can "
"group results by hostnames or content codes. (Content codes can be defined "
"in your properties' <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> field using the $content_code "
"variable.) "
msgstr ""
"获取一段时间内 7 层带宽汇总。您可以按加速域名或内容代码对结果进行分组。（内容"
"代码可以在加速项目的 <i>loadBalancerLogic</i> 字段中通过 $content_code 变量定"
"义。）"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/summary
msgid "Get Origin Fast Route IP List"
msgstr "获取回源快速通道 IP 列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a list of IP addresses."
msgstr "响应体包含 IP 地址列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/effectiveDate/description
msgid "RFC 3339 date indicating when the IP addresses became effective."
msgstr "RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示这些 IP 地址的生效时间。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV4/description
msgid "IPv4 addresses used by origin fast route servers."
msgstr "回源快速通道服务器使用的 IPv4 地址。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV6/description
msgid "IPv6 addresses used by origin fast route servers."
msgstr "回源快速通道服务器使用的 IPv6 地址。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1originFastRouteIpList/get/description
msgid ""
"This API returns a list of IP addresses used by our origin fast route "
"servers. If you use our [fast route feature](</docs/edge-logic/supported-"
"directives#origin_fast_route>) to make the connections faster and more "
"reliable and wish to restrict access to your origin servers, add these IP "
"addresses to your allow lists.\n"
msgstr ""
"本 API 返回回源快速通道服务器使用的 IP 地址列表。如果您使用了[回源快速通道功"
"能](</docs/edge-logic/supported-directives#origin_fast_route>)来提升连接速度"
"和可靠性，并希望限制对源站服务器的访问，请将这些 IP 地址加入允许列表。\n"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of staging servers"
msgstr "获取演练服务器列表"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a list of staging servers that can be used."
msgstr "响应体包含可用的演练环境服务器列表。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/stagingServers/description
msgid "Each entry describe a staging server."
msgstr "每个条目描述一台演练环境服务器。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/stagingServers/items/properties/ip/description
msgid "IP address. It can be IPv4 or IPv6 format."
msgstr "IP 地址，可以是 IPv4 或 IPv6 格式。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/stagingServers/items/properties/code/description
msgid "A code representing the staging server."
msgstr "代表该演练环境服务器的代码。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/stagingServers/items/properties/location/description
msgid "Location of the staging server."
msgstr "演练环境服务器的位置。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/stagingServers/items/properties/ipVersion/description
msgid "Indicates the format of the 'ip' field."
msgstr "表示 'ip' 字段的格式。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1stagingServers/get/description
msgid ""
"This API returns a list of IP addresses of servers that can be used to test "
"deployments of properties and certificates to 'staging'. We recommend "
"deploying to 'staging' and testing before deploying to 'production'."
msgstr ""
"本 API 返回可用于测试部署到 'staging' 的加速项目和证书的服务器 IP 地址列表。"
"建议您先部署到 'staging' 进行测试，再部署到 'production'。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/summary
msgid "Get a summary of log aggregation points used during a period of time."
msgstr "获取一段时间内所用日志汇聚点的汇总。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/description
msgid "The response body contains a summary of aggregation points' use."
msgstr "响应体包含汇聚点使用情况的汇总。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid "An array of objects summarizing use of aggregation points."
msgstr "汇总汇聚点使用情况的对象数组。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/title
msgid "logAggregationPointSummary"
msgstr "logAggregationPointSummary"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/description
msgid "Summarizes use of a log aggregation point."
msgstr "汇总一个日志汇聚点的使用情况。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/properties/id/description
msgid "ID of a log aggregation point."
msgstr "日志汇聚点的 ID。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/properties/ingestEntries/description
msgid "Number of entries ingested."
msgstr "接收的条目数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/properties/destinationRequests/description
msgid "Total number of requests made to the destination URL."
msgstr "向目标 URL 发出的请求总数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/summary/items/properties/ingestBytes/description
msgid "Total number of bytes ingested."
msgstr "接收的总字节数。"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/parameters/0/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the beginning of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone. Example: "
"<code>startdate=2025-03-14T00:00:00Z</code>"
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示时间段的开始。时间必须使用 UTC 时区。示例："
"<code>startdate=2025-03-14T00:00:00Z</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2025-03-18T00:00:00Z</code>"
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 格式的日期，表示时间段的结束。时间必须使用 UTC 时区。示例："
"<code>enddate=2025-03-18T00:00:00Z</code>"

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints~1summaryReport/get/description
msgid ""
"This API summarizes use of your log aggregation points during a time period."
msgstr "本 API 汇总一段时间内您的日志汇聚点的使用情况。"

#. /components/securitySchemes/API Key/description
msgid ""
"All requests to the CDN Pro platform must be authenticated using an API "
"account name and key assigned to your organization. For security, the API "
"key is not passed directly but is secured as described in the example script "
"below.\n"
"\n"
"The authentication type is HTTP Basic, and the authorization string is "
"specified in the HTTP header field called Authorization.\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"<code>\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"#URL of the CDN Pro API server\n"
"API_SERVER=https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}\n"
"\n"
"#You will be given the following information by the {{title}} sales team\n"
"USER=\"{API user name}\"\n"
"API_KEY=\"{API key (make sure to escape the $ sign if any)}\"\n"
"\n"
"#Date in RFC 1123 format\n"
"DATE=`LC_TIME=\"C\" date -u \"+%a, %d %b %Y %H:%M:%S GMT\"`\n"
"\n"
"#Generate the password. Raw output from openssl by adding the \"-binary\" "
"flag\n"
"passw=$(echo -n \"$DATE\" | openssl dgst -sha1 -hmac \"$API_KEY\" -binary | "
"base64)\n"
"echo \" \"\n"
"\n"
"#Construct the curl command to query list of properties\n"
"apiCall=\"curl -i --url '${API_SERVER}/cdn/properties'\n"
"               -X GET\n"
"               -u $USER:$passw\n"
"               -H 'Date: $DATE'\n"
"               -H 'Accept: application/json'\"\n"
"\n"
"eval $apiCall\n"
"echo \" \"\n"
"</code>\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"If you are a reseller you can also specify a child customer's ID in an On-"
"Behalf-Of HTTP header field to make API calls to manage your child "
"customer.\n"
"\n"
"A more advanced Bash script allowing you to make calls to many CDN Pro APIs "
"is available <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK/tree/master/cdn/"
"bash\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"所有发往 CDN Pro 平台的请求都必须使用分配给您组织的 API 账号名称和密钥进行身"
"份验证。出于安全考虑，API 密钥不会直接传递，而是按照下方示例脚本所示的方式进"
"行保护。\n"
"\n"
"身份验证类型为 HTTP Basic，授权字符串在名为 Authorization 的 HTTP 头字段中指"
"定。\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"<code>\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"#URL of the CDN Pro API server\n"
"API_SERVER=https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}\n"
"\n"
"#You will be given the following information by the {{title}} sales team\n"
"USER=\"{API user name}\"\n"
"API_KEY=\"{API key (make sure to escape the $ sign if any)}\"\n"
"\n"
"#Date in RFC 1123 format\n"
"DATE=`LC_TIME=\"C\" date -u \"+%a, %d %b %Y %H:%M:%S GMT\"`\n"
"\n"
"#Generate the password. Raw output from openssl by adding the \"-binary\" "
"flag\n"
"passw=$(echo -n \"$DATE\" | openssl dgst -sha1 -hmac \"$API_KEY\" -binary | "
"base64)\n"
"echo \" \"\n"
"\n"
"#Construct the curl command to query list of properties\n"
"apiCall=\"curl -i --url '${API_SERVER}/cdn/properties'\n"
"               -X GET\n"
"               -u $USER:$passw\n"
"               -H 'Date: $DATE'\n"
"               -H 'Accept: application/json'\"\n"
"\n"
"eval $apiCall\n"
"echo \" \"\n"
"</code>\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"如果您是代理商，还可以在 On-Behalf-Of HTTP 头字段中指定子客户的 ID，通过 API "
"调用管理您的子客户。\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK/tree/master/cdn/bash\">此处</"
"a>提供了一个更高级的 Bash 脚本，可用于调用多个 CDN Pro API。"

#. /tags/0/description
msgid ""
"If your content requires TLS, you must create a certificate and <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/deployment-management\">deploy</a> it along with associated <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/property-management\">properties</a>.  For test purposes, "
"you can create a self-signed certificate. Certificates are versioned. Each "
"update to a certificate generates a new immutable version. You can choose to "
"deploy any version to staging or production. If your property's origin "
"requires authentication using a certificate, you should also call the API to "
"create the required certificate, upload it, and deploy to use it. If you are "
"a reseller, you may share your certificates with your child customers who "
"can then use the certificates, but not modify them."
msgstr ""
"如果您的内容需要使用 TLS，您必须创建证书，并将其与相关的<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"property-management\">加速项目</a>一起<a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-"
"management\">部署</a>。出于测试目的，您可以创建自签名证书。证书是有版本的，每"
"次修改证书都会生成一个新的不可变版本。您可以选择将任意版本部署到演练环境或生"
"产环境。如果您加速项目的源站要求使用证书进行身份验证，您也应调用 API 创建所需"
"证书、上传证书并进行部署，以便使用该证书。如果您是代理商，可以将证书共享给子"
"客户，子客户可以使用这些证书，但不能修改。"

#. /tags/1/description
msgid ""
"A property is the configuration of one or more hostnames (domains) that need "
"to be <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-management\">deployed</a> to the CDN Pro "
"servers. A property can have multiple versions. A property version that has "
"been deployed cannot be updated or <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"validation\">validated</a> again. You can <a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"management/createpropertyversion\">create a new version of a property</a> by "
"making a clone (or copy) of an existing version. <p>The following figure "
"shows the steps for creating an acceleration service for a hostname.</p><img "
"src=\"/static/content-assets/mileweb/docs-content-cdn/en/docs/resources/"
"images/getting-started-flowchart.png\">"
msgstr ""
"加速项目是一个或多个加速域名（域名）的配置，需要<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"deployment-management\">部署</a>到 CDN Pro 服务器上。一个加速项目可以有多个版"
"本。已部署的加速项目版本不能再修改或再次<a href=\"/apidocs/property-"
"validation\">验证</a>。您可以通过克隆（或复制）现有版本来<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"property-management/createpropertyversion\">创建加速项目的新版本</a>。<p>下图"
"展示了为加速域名创建加速服务的步骤。</p><img src=\"/static/content-assets/"
"mileweb/docs-content-cdn/zh/docs/resources/images/getting-started-"
"flowchart.png\">"

#. /tags/2/description
msgid ""
"After you <a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">create a "
"property</a>, you must validate it to ensure that the settings are "
"syntactically correct before you can <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-"
"management\">deploy</a> it to staging or production. The validation process "
"is an asynchronous action. APIs are available to check the status of your "
"validation tasks."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">创建加速项目</a>后，"
"您必须先对其进行验证，确保设置的语法正确，然后才能将其<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"deployment-management\">部署</a>到演练环境或生产环境。验证过程是异步操作。您"
"可以通过相关 API 查询验证任务的状态。"

#. /tags/3/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to define secrets that are used to hide sensitive "
"information, such as preventing a password from being visible in an API call "
"or within the CDN Pro portal. For example, a secret could be a key used to "
"authenticate client requests to your origin server. By creating a secret and "
"referring to it in your [Edge Logic](</docs/edge-logic/intro>) using the "
"secret's name via the syntax `$SECRET(secretName)`, or by setting "
"`origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey` to `$SECRET(secretName)`, the key "
"itself would not be exposed when viewing a property through the CDN Pro "
"portal or fetching it using the CDN Pro API."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 定义保密信息，用于隐藏敏感信息，例如避免密码在 API 调用或 "
"CDN Pro 控制台中可见。例如，保密信息可以是用于向源站服务器验证客户端请求的密"
"钥。创建保密信息后，在[边缘逻辑](</docs/edge-logic/intro>)中通过 "
"`$SECRET(secretName)` 语法使用保密信息名称引用它，或将 "
"`origins.authentication.awsS3.secretKey` 设置为 `$SECRET(secretName)`，这样在"
"通过 CDN Pro 控制台查看加速项目或通过 CDN Pro API 获取加速项目时，密钥本身都"
"不会暴露。"

#. /tags/4/description
msgid ""
"Deployment is the process of pushing out your property and certificate "
"configurations to the CDN Pro cache servers. We highly recommend you [deploy "
"to our <i>staging</i> environment to test your configurations before "
"deploying to <i>production</i>](</docs/portal/edge-configurations/testing-"
"property>). <h2>Testing a property deployed to production</h2> After you <a "
"href=\"/apidocs/edge-hostname-management/createedgehostname\">create an edge "
"hostname</a> and set your DNS server to point the edge hostname to your "
"property's hostname, you can browse your content under the hostname."
msgstr ""
"部署是将您的加速项目和证书配置推送到 CDN Pro 缓存服务器的过程。我们强烈建议您"
"[先部署到<i>演练</i>环境测试配置，再部署到<i>生产</i>环境](</docs/portal/"
"edge-configurations/testing-property>)。<h2>测试已部署到生产环境的加速项目</"
"h2> <a href=\"/apidocs/edge-hostname-management/createedgehostname\">创建调度"
"域名</a>并在 DNS 服务器上将加速项目的加速域名指向该调度域名后，您即可通过该加"
"速域名浏览您的内容。"

#. /tags/5/description
msgid ""
"You must <a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">create "
"properties</a> to manage your configurations on CDN Pro. Several APIs are "
"available that allow you to get summarized information about the hostnames "
"(or domains) of properties that have been <a href=\"/apidocs/deployment-"
"management/createdeployment\">deployed</a> to production or staging."
msgstr ""
"您必须<a href=\"/apidocs/property-management/createproperty\">创建加速项目</"
"a>才能在 CDN Pro 上管理您的配置。您可以通过多个 API 获取已<a href=\"/apidocs/"
"deployment-management/createdeployment\">部署</a>到生产环境或演练环境的加速项"
"目中加速域名（或域名）的汇总信息。"

#. /tags/6/description
msgid ""
"You must create an edge hostname for properties deployed to production. You "
"can define rules to apply to visitors from different client zones that are "
"combinations of geographic regions and ISPs.  You must modify your DNS "
"records to point each property's hostnames to an edge hostname in order for "
"visitor requests to be handled by CDN Pro. Different properties' hostnames "
"may point to the same edge hostname if the same rules apply."
msgstr ""
"您必须为部署到生产环境的加速项目创建调度域名。您可以定义规则，应用于来自不同"
"客户端分区（由地理区域和运营商组合而成）的访问者。您必须修改 DNS 记录，将每个"
"加速项目的加速域名指向调度域名，访问者的请求才能由 CDN Pro 处理。如果适用相同"
"的规则，不同加速项目的加速域名可以指向同一个调度域名。"

#. /tags/7/description
msgid ""
"Call our report APIs to get information about your visitors including edge "
"and origin traffic, requests, status code details, and log files."
msgstr ""
"调用报表 API 获取访问者的相关信息，包括边缘流量和回源流量、请求数、状态码详情"
"以及日志文件。"

#. /tags/8/description
msgid ""
"Add text annotations to highlight events related to traffic to your "
"hostnames. These annotations will appear in the [CDN Pro portal](https://"
"console.{{siteDomain}}/cdn) when you look at the reports."
msgstr ""
"添加文本注释，以标注与您加速域名流量相关的事件。在 [CDN Pro 控制台](https://"
"console.{{siteDomain}}/cdn)中查看报表时，这些注释会显示出来。"

#. /tags/9/description
msgid ""
"The content management APIs allow you to request an update (or purge) of "
"your cached content ahead of the schedule determined by your <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/property-management/getpropertyversion\">property configuration</"
"a>.  You can purge files or directories.  The purge requests are "
"asynchronous. APIs are available for you to check the status of your purge "
"requests. You can also prefetch URLs to warm up your cache in advance of "
"requests from visitors. This allows you to manage traffic to your origin "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过内容管理 API 请求更新（或刷新）缓存内容，而不必等到<a href=\"/"
"apidocs/property-management/getpropertyversion\">加速项目配置</a>所确定的时"
"间。您可以刷新文件或目录。刷新请求是异步的，您可以通过相关 API 查询刷新请求的"
"状态。您还可以预取 URL，在访问者请求到达之前预热缓存，从而管理发往源站服务器"
"的流量。"

#. /tags/10/description
msgid ""
"Create and manage users who access the [CDN Pro portal](https://console."
"{{siteDomain}}/cdn)."
msgstr ""
"创建和管理访问 [CDN Pro 控制台](https://console.{{siteDomain}}/cdn)的用户。"

#. /tags/11/description
msgid ""
"Create and manage additional API accounts used to call the CDN Pro APIs. You "
"can customize which set of endpoints the API accounts can access by "
"specifying <a href=\"/apidocs/api-access-control/post-cdn-"
"apipermissions\">API permissions</a>."
msgstr ""
"创建和管理用于调用 CDN Pro API 的其他 API 账号。您可以通过指定 <a href=\"/"
"apidocs/api-access-control/post-cdn-apipermissions\">API 权限</a>来自定义 "
"API 账号可访问的接口集合。"

#. /tags/12/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to update customer-level portal settings and contact "
"information as well as to reset the administrator API key. Resellers can "
"also create, update, delete, and get a list of customer accounts."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 修改客户级别的控制台设置和联系信息，以及重置管理员 API 密"
"钥。代理商还可以创建、修改、删除客户账号以及获取客户账号列表。"

#. /tags/13/description
msgid ""
"Obtain a summary of API calls that have been made by you or on your behalf."
msgstr "获取由您或代表您发起的 API 调用的汇总。"

#. /tags/14/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to fetch CDN settings that apply to your account. If "
"you are a reseller, you can use APIs to manage the service quotas of your "
"child customers."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 获取适用于您账号的 CDN 设置。如果您是代理商，还可以使用这"
"些 API 管理子客户的服务配额。"

#. /tags/15/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to customize what a <a href=\"/apidocs/api-account-"
"management/post-ngadmin-apiaccounts\">CDN Pro API account</a> can do by "
"specifying the categories of accessible endpoints."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 指定可访问的接口类别，从而自定义 <a href=\"/apidocs/api-"
"account-management/post-ngadmin-apiaccounts\">CDN Pro API 账号</a>的权限范"
"围。"

#. /tags/16/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to define webhooks or callbacks that are invoked when "
"an asynchronous operation such as a deployment, purge, or prefetch request "
"completes."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 定义 Webhook 或回调，在部署、刷新或预取请求等异步操作完成"
"时触发。"

#. /tags/17/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to customize the format of the access logs you can "
"download using <a href=\"/apidocs/reports/get-cdn-report-logdownload\">our "
"API</a>. Logs are available for a hostname only for requests that are made "
"after you have defined an applicable log configuration format for the "
"hostname."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 自定义可使用<a href=\"/apidocs/reports/get-cdn-report-"
"logdownload\">我们的 API</a> 下载的访问日志格式。只有在您为某个加速域名定义了"
"适用的日志配置格式之后发起的请求，才能获取该加速域名的日志。"

#. /tags/18/description
msgid ""
"These APIs allow you to create log aggregation points which are ingestion "
"URLs that receive raw log entries from the CDN Pro servers. This option is "
"available for those who use our realTimeLog advanced feature."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过这些 API 创建日志汇聚点，即从 CDN Pro 服务器接收原始日志条目的接收 "
"URL。此选项适用于使用 realTimeLog 高级功能的客户。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The CDN Pro API can be used to fully automate the CDN Pro service. "
#~ "<p>Along with this document, we also created <a href=\"https://github.com/"
#~ "mileweb/CDNProSDK\">CDNProSDK</a> to help you get started with the API "
#~ "and integrate it. Its <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK/tree/"
#~ "master/cdn/bash\">bash</a> version includes the \"cdnapi.sh\" shell "
#~ "script used in this document's examples.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "您可以使用 CDN Pro API 实现 CDN Pro 服务的全面自动化。<p>除本文档外，我们"
#~ "还提供了 <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/CDNProSDK\">CDNProSDK</a>，"
#~ "帮助您快速上手并集成 API。其 <a href=\"https://github.com/mileweb/"
#~ "CDNProSDK/tree/master/cdn/bash\">bash</a> 版本包含本文档示例中使用的 "
#~ "\"cdnapi.sh\" 脚本。</p>"

